package com.pokedaisy.app.companion.data

// Generated by scripts/gen_zh_dex_descriptions.py.
// Chinese: bundled Pokédex descriptions (MIT);
// English: pokeemerald-zh-main's pokedex_text.h, the ROM's own text the entry is checked against.
// Each row: Chinese description\u0001English text, by national dex number.
internal val chineseDexDescriptions: Array<String> = arrayOf(
    "", // 0: none
    "背上的种子里储存着营养，所以即使好几天不吃东西 也可以活得好好的！\u0001BULBASAUR can be seen napping in bright\nsunlight. There is a seed on its back.\nBy soaking up the sun's rays, the seed\ngrows progressively larger.", // 1: Bulbasaur
    "它的花苞会在吸收养分后 长大。当花苞发出香味时，就预示着它快要开花了。\u0001To support its bulb, IVYSAUR's legs\ngrow sturdy. If it spends more time lying in\nthe sunlight, the bud will soon bloom into\na large flower.", // 2: Ivysaur
    "它背上开出的大花 能够吸收太阳光 并将其转换为能量。\u0001VENUSAUR's flower is said to take on vivid\ncolors if it gets plenty of nutrition and\nsunlight. The flower's aroma soothes the\nemotions of people.", // 3: Venusaur
    "要是把它带到安静的地方，就能听到它的尾巴燃烧时 发出的微小的声音。\u0001The flame that burns at the tip of its\ntail is an indication of its emotions.\nThe flame wavers when CHARMANDER is\nhappy, and blazes when it is enraged.", // 4: Charmander
    "在与强敌战斗的过程中，如果情绪变得兴奋起来，有时会喷出青白色的烈火。\u0001Without pity, its sharp claws destroy foes.\nIf it encounters a strong enemy, it\nbecomes agitated, and the flame on its\ntail flares with a bluish white color.", // 5: Charmeleon
    "从口中喷出灼热的火焰时，尾巴尖端的红色火焰 会燃烧得更加猛烈。\u0001A CHARIZARD flies about in search of\nstrong opponents. It breathes intense\nflames that can melt any material. However,\nit will never torch a weaker foe.", // 6: Charizard
    "通过从水面喷水来捕食。 在危急时刻会将四肢 缩入龟壳里保护自己。\u0001Its shell is not just for protection.\nIts rounded shape and the grooves on its\nsurface minimize resistance in water,\nenabling SQUIRTLE to swim at high speeds.", // 7: Squirtle
    "如果拍打它的头部，它会 把头缩进壳里，但尾巴 还是会露出来一点点。\u0001Its large tail is covered with rich, thick\nfur that deepens in color with age.\nThe scratches on its shell are evidence\nof this POKéMON's toughness in battle.", // 8: Wartortle
    "一旦锁定了目标，它会以超越了消防 水枪的力道来喷水。\u0001The waterspouts that protrude from its\nshell are highly accurate. Their bullets of\nwater can precisely nail tin cans from\na distance of over 160 feet.", // 9: Blastoise
    "被鸟宝可梦袭击时 会从触角中释放出臭气抵抗，但也经常会成为鸟食。\u0001Its voracious appetite compels it to\ndevour leaves bigger than itself without\nhesitation. It releases a terribly strong\nodor from its antennae.", // 10: Caterpie
    "壳中藏着软乎乎的身体。 几乎不动是为了防止 身体一不留神就露出来。\u0001Its shell is as hard as an iron slab.\nA METAPOD does not move very much\nbecause it is preparing its soft innards\nfor evolution inside the shell.", // 11: Metapod
    "仔细观察那对大眼睛的话，会发现其实是许许多多小眼睛 聚集在一起形成的。\u0001It has a superior ability to search for\ndelicious honey from flowers. It can seek,\nextract, and carry honey from flowers\nblooming over six miles away.", // 12: Butterfree
    "头上长有尖锐的针。 它喜欢藏在森林或 草丛里大量吞食树叶。\u0001A WEEDLE has an extremely acute sense\nof smell. It distinguishes its favorite\nkinds of leaves from those it dislikes by\nsniffing with its big red proboscis (nose).", // 13: Weedle
    "虽然几乎动也动不了，但是如果遇到了危险，有时似乎会竖起毒刺来反抗。\u0001It remains virtually immobile while it\nclings to a tree. However, on the inside,\nit busily prepares for evolution. This is\nevident from how hot its shell becomes.", // 14: Kakuna
    "它会用双手和 尾部的3根毒针 反复刺伤敌人。\u0001A BEEDRILL is extremely territorial.\nFor safety reasons, no one should \never approach its nest. If angered,\nthey will attack in a swarm.", // 15: Beedrill
    "性格沉着冷静，即使受到 攻击也很少反击，只会朝 对手扬起沙子保护自己。\u0001It has an extremely sharp sense of\ndirection. It can unerringly return home to\nits nest, however far it may be removed\nfrom its familiar surroundings.", // 16: Pidgey
    "拥有超群的体力，而且 飞翔范围广，经常飞到 很远的地方寻找食物。\u0001This POKéMON flies around, patrolling its\nlarge territory. If its living space is\nviolated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly\npunishing the foe with its sharp claws.", // 17: Pidgeotto
    "以2马赫的飞行速度来 觅食。它巨大的爪子是 非常令人惧怕的武器。\u0001This POKéMON has gorgeous, glossy\nfeathers. Many TRAINERS are so captivated\nby the beautiful feathers on its head that\nthey choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON.", // 18: Pidgeot
    "门牙会终生生长，所以必须要保养。 不准备好锉刀的话，会把柱子都啃掉。\u0001A RATTATA is cautious in the extreme.\nEven while it is asleep, it constantly\nmoves its ears and listens for danger.\nIt will make its nest anywhere.", // 19: Rattata
    "游泳很在行。后脚带有小小的蹼，会渡过河流，有时还会渡过大海。\u0001A RATICATE's sturdy fangs grow steadily.\nTo keep them ground down, it gnaws on\nrocks and logs. It may even chew on the\nwalls of houses.", // 20: Raticate
    "翅膀很短，飞行也不大在行。 忙忙碌碌地来回走动，啄食草丛里的虫宝可梦。\u0001Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile\naway. If its high, keening cry is heard\nechoing all around, it is a sign that they\nare warning each other of danger.", // 21: Spearow
    "因为很强壮而持久力优秀。 即使载着很重的货物持续 飞行一整天也平心静气。\u0001Its long neck and elongated beak are\nideal for catching prey in soil or water.\nIt deftly moves this extended and skinny\nbeak to pluck prey.", // 22: Fearow
    "甚至可以通过让颚脱位来 吞食比自己更大的猎物。 进食后就会蜷缩起身体进行休息。\u0001An EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while\nit rests. This position allows it to quickly\nrespond to an enemy from any direction\nwith a threat from its upraised head.", // 23: Ekans
    "根据最新的研究显示，它们腹部的花纹有着 20种以上不同的图案。\u0001This POKéMON has a terrifically strong\nconstricting power. It can even flatten\nsteel oil drums. Once it wraps its body\naround its foe, escaping is impossible.", // 24: Arbok
    "最近发表了聚集大量皮卡丘，建造发电厂的计划。\u0001It stores electricity in the electric sacs\non its cheeks. When it releases pent-up\nenergy in a burst, the electric power is\nequal to a lightning bolt.", // 25: Pikachu
    "电击有时候会达到十万伏特，不小心碰到的话，连印度象也会昏厥。\u0001If it stores too much electricity, its\nbehavior turns aggressive. To avoid this,\nit occasionally discharges excess energy\nand calms itself down.", // 26: Raichu
    "可以蜷缩身体变成球的样子。 骨碌碌滚动着在沙漠里高速移动。\u0001When it curls up in a ball, it can make any\nattack bounce off harmlessly. Its hide has\nturned tough and solid as a result of\nliving in the desert.", // 27: Sandshrew
    "用爪子爬上树，当猎物出现时，身体就蜷缩成尖刺球从高处落下。\u0001It curls up in a ball to protect itself from\nenemy attacks. It also curls up to prevent\nheatstroke during the daytime when\ntemperatures rise sharply.", // 28: Sandslash
    "虽然它性格温顺不喜欢战斗，但由于小犄角中含有毒液，请一定要小心提防。\u0001Its highly toxic barbs are thought to have\ndeveloped as protection for this small-\nbodied POKéMON. When enraged, it releases\na horrible toxin from its horn.", // 29: Nidoran♀
    "待在巢穴深处的时候，它一定会把身上的刺收起来。 这表明它正处于放松状态。\u0001When it is with its friends or\nfamily, its barbs are tucked away to\nprevent injury. It appears to become\nnervous if separated from the others.", // 30: Nidorina
    "坚硬的鳞片覆盖着 强壮的身体。据说它的 鳞片会自己长出新的。\u0001It is adept at sending foes flying with\nharsh tackles using its tough, scaly body.\nThis POKéMON is at its strongest when\nit is defending its young.", // 31: Nidoqueen
    "一直竖起它的大耳朵 感知周围的情形。当它 察觉到危险便会使用毒针。\u0001The male NIDORAN has developed muscles\nthat freely move its ears in any direction.\nEven the slightest sound does not escape\nthis POKéMON's notice.", // 32: Nidoran♂
    "头上的犄角里含有毒素，当犄角撞穿了什么东西时，毒素就会随着冲击而流出。\u0001Its horn is harder than a diamond.\nIf it senses a hostile presence, all the\nbarbs on its back bristle up at once, and it\nchallenges the foe with all its might.", // 33: Nidorino
    "通过活用自己钢一般坚硬的 皮肤来使出强力的撞击。它的 犄角坚硬得能够刺穿钻石。\u0001A NIDOKING's thick tail packs enormously\ndestructive power capable of toppling\na metal transmission tower. Once it goes\non a rampage, there is no stopping it.", // 34: Nidoking
    "因为可爱的举止和样子，不论男女老幼都很喜欢它。 但数量稀少。\u0001On every night of a full moon, they come\nout to play. When dawn arrives, the tired\nCLEFAIRY go to sleep nestled up against\neach other in deep and quiet mountains.", // 35: Clefairy
    "不喜欢在人面前现身。 喜欢群居在深山里静静地生活。\u0001A CLEFABLE uses its wings to skip lightly \nas if it were flying. Its bouncy step\nlets it even walk on water. On quiet,\nmoonlit nights, it strolls on lakes.", // 36: Clefable
    "因为毛色和尾巴非常漂亮，所以很有人气。伴随着成长，尾巴会分开，长得越来越多。\u0001It can freely control fire, making fiery\norbs fly like will-o'-the-wisps. Just\nbefore evolution, its six tails grow hot \nas if on fire.", // 37: Vulpix
    "至今还流传着9位圣者 合体变成九尾的传说，是充满神秘色彩的宝可梦。\u0001It has long been said that each of the\nnine tails embody an enchanted power.\nA long-lived NINETALES will have fur that\nshines like gold.", // 38: Ninetales
    "把肚子鼓得大大的，唱出神奇的旋律。 听到后就会马上昏昏欲睡。\u0001Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a\nJIGGLYPUFF's song. The sound waves of its\nsinging voice match the brain waves of\nsomeone in a deep sleep.", // 39: Jigglypuff
    "蓬松的毛发会随着季节转换 而掉落。收集这些毛发后 纺织成的毛线是高级商品。\u0001Its fur is the ultimate in luxuriousness.\nSleeping alongside a WIGGLYTUFF is simply\ndivine. Its body expands seemingly without\nend when it inhales.", // 40: Wigglytuff
    "白天在洞穴里睡觉。 因为没有眼睛，所以用超音波 一边探测周围，一边飞行。\u0001While living in pitch-black caverns, their\neyes gradually grew shut and deprived\nthem of vision. They use ultrasonic waves\nto detect obstacles.", // 41: Zubat
    "粗粗的牙齿像吸管一样，中间是空的，因而意想不到的脆弱。 是为了吸血而特别进化的。\u0001Its fangs easily puncture even thick\nanimal hide. It loves to feast on the blood\nof people and POKéMON. It flits about in\ndarkness and strikes from behind.", // 42: Golbat
    "要是以为它是普通的草而 将它拔起，就会听到它的叫声。 这让人感到莫名的恐怖。\u0001This POKéMON grows by absorbing moonlight.\nDuring the daytime, it buries itself in the\nground, leaving only its leaves exposed to\navoid detection by its enemies.", // 43: Oddish
    "看似口水的东西其实是 甜甜的蜜。非常黏稠，只要碰到就会一直黏住。\u0001A horribly noxious honey drools from its\nmouth. One whiff of the honey can result\nin memory loss. Some fans are said to\nenjoy this overwhelming stink, however.", // 44: Gloom
    "为了散布有毒的花粉 而摇动其巨大的花瓣，同时发出震耳的响声。\u0001In seasons when it produces more pollen,\nthe air around a VILEPLUME turns yellow\nwith the powder as it walks. The pollen is\nhighly toxic and causes paralysis.", // 45: Vileplume
    "即使不停地吃，获取的营养也几乎都会被 背上生长的蘑菇夺走。\u0001A PARAS has parasitic tochukaso\nmushrooms growing on its back. They grow\nby drawing nutrients from the host. They\nare valued as a medicine for long life.", // 46: Paras
    "大大的蘑菇操纵着派拉斯特。 经常和灯罩夜菇争夺领地。\u0001PARASECT are known to infest the roots of\nlarge trees en masse and drain nutrients.\nWhen an infested tree dies, they move\nonto another tree all at once.", // 47: Parasect
    "在明亮的地方你便能发现它 具有雷达功能的大眼其实是 由许多个小眼睛聚集而成的。\u0001Its coat of thin, stiff hair that covers\nits entire body is said to have evolved\nfor protection. Its large eyes never fail\nto spot even miniscule prey.", // 48: Venonat
    "如果不小心把它翅膀上的鳞粉 沾到了身上，那不但会很难去除，更糟的是毒素也会从那里渗入。\u0001VENOMOTH are nocturnal--they only are\nactive at night. Their favorite prey are\ninsects that gather around streetlights,\nattracted by the light in the darkness.", // 49: Venomoth
    "在地下啃食树根。 因有些品种的蔬菜会遭其啃食，是可能对农户造成灾害的宝可梦。\u0001DIGLETT are raised in most farms.\nThe reason is simple--wherever they\nburrow, the soil is left perfectly tilled\nfor growing delicious crops.", // 50: Diglett
    "三胞胎合作行动。 甚至连地下100公里都能挖到，这种力量是团队合作的成果。\u0001Because the triplets originally split from\none body, they think exactly alike.\nThey work cooperatively to burrow\nendlessly through the ground.", // 51: Dugtrio
    "白天就一直睡啊睡地度过，太阳落山时才开始活动。 在夜晚的街道上搜寻硬币。\u0001MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into\ntheir paws to silently sneak about.\nFor some reason, this POKéMON loves\nshiny coins that glitter with light.", // 52: Meowth
    "性情粗暴，只要视线对上就会 猛扑过来。被锐利的爪子抓到的话，就会留下很深的伤口。\u0001A PERSIAN's six bold whiskers sense air\nmovements to determine what is in its\nvicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed\nby the whiskers.", // 53: Persian
    "不受自己控制，时不时地会产生念力，导致头痛流泪。\u0001When its headache intensifies, it starts\nusing strange powers. However, it has no\nrecollection of its powers, so it always\nlooks befuddled and bewildered.", // 54: Psyduck
    "据说戴着额头红色的部分 就会被赋予神通力，过去也曾因此被人类过度捕捉。\u0001A GOLDUCK is an adept swimmer.\nIt sometimes joins competitive swimmers\nin training. It uses psychic powers when\nits forehead shimmers with light.", // 55: Golduck
    "会没有任何征兆突然发怒。 如果大肆胡闹后谁都不在了的话，又会因无法忍受孤独而再次发怒。\u0001When it starts shaking and its nasal\nbreathing turns rough, it's a sure sign\nof anger. However, since this happens\ninstantly, there is no time to flee.", // 56: Mankey
    "因为太过生气以致于就这么死去，这种事也是有的。 但死的时候表情很安详。\u0001When it becomes furious, its blood\ncirculation becomes more robust, and\nits muscles are made stronger. But it\nalso becomes much less intelligent.", // 57: Primeape
    "机灵而忠诚。但是对于 不认识的或是侵犯领地的，会狂吠不停并作出威吓。\u0001Its superb sense of smell ensures that\nthis POKéMON won't forget any scent,\nno matter what. It uses its sense of smell\nto detect the emotions of others.", // 58: Growlithe
    "在东方的古代传说中也会出现。 充满威严，强壮而又美丽的宝可梦。\u0001This fleet-footed POKéMON is said to run\nover 6,200 miles in a single day and night.\nThe fire that blazes wildly within its body\nis its source of power.", // 59: Arcanine
    "漩涡是透明可见的内脏。 当颜色带有白色时，说明是生什么病了。\u0001It is possible to see this POKéMON's spiral\ninnards right through its thin skin.\nHowever, the skin is also very flexible.\nEven sharp fangs bounce right off it.", // 60: Poliwag
    "即使在陆地上也能正常生活，但因为天敌的宝可梦较少，所以更喜欢在水中生活。\u0001Its body surface is always wet and slick\nwith an oily fluid. Because of this greasy\ncovering, it can easily slip and slide out\nof the clutches of any enemy in battle.", // 61: Poliwhirl
    "阿罗拉的蚊香泳士擅长蛙泳。 模仿蚊香泳士学习游泳的孩子也很多。\u0001Its highly developed muscles never grow\nfatigued, however much it exercises.\nThis POKéMON can swim back and forth\nacross the Pacific Ocean without effort.", // 62: Poliwrath
    "1天中有18个小时在睡觉。 即使睡着，也能用瞬间移动 在树上移动，采树果吃。\u0001A POKéMON that sleeps 18 hours a day.\nObservation revealed that it uses\nTELEPORT to change its location once\nevery hour.", // 63: Abra
    "用精神力量浮在空中睡觉。 会把弹力十足的 尾巴当成枕头来用。\u0001It is rumored that a boy with psychic\nabilities suddenly transformed into\nKADABRA while he was assisting research\ninto extrasensory powers.", // 64: Kadabra
    "智商大约有5000。 强大的念力满溢出来，光是呆在旁边就会头痛不已。\u0001While it has strong psychic abilities and\nhigh intelligence, an ALAKAZAM's muscles\nare very weak. It uses psychic power to\nmove its body.", // 65: Alakazam
    "非常喜欢锻炼。 盯着自己每天不断增大的肌肉，愈加勤奋地锻炼。\u0001It continually undertakes strenuous\ntraining to master all forms of martial\narts. Its strength lets it easily hoist\na sumo wrestler onto its shoulders.", // 66: Machop
    "不断锻炼的结果就是 拥有了非常惊人的力量。 灵活运用这力量帮助人类工作。\u0001A belt is worn by a MACHOKE to keep its\noverwhelming power under control.\nBecause it is so dangerous, no one has\never removed the belt.", // 67: Machoke
    "使出百万吨级的拳击，将阻挡的敌人击飞到 地平线的另一端。\u0001It is impossible to defend against punches\nand chops doled out by its four arms.\nIts fighting spirit flares up when it faces\na tough opponent.", // 68: Machamp
    "喜欢温度高，有一定 湿度的地方。它会用 身上的藤蔓抓小虫来吃。\u0001A BELLSPROUT's thin and flexible body lets\nit bend and sway to avoid any attack,\nhowever strong it may be. From its mouth,\nit leaks a fluid that melts even iron.", // 69: Bellsprout
    "它在肚子饿的时候会 吞掉周围会动的东西，分泌溶解液让其致命。\u0001At night, a WEEPINBELL hangs on to a tree\nbranch with its hooked rear and sleeps.\nIf it moves around in its sleep, it may\nwake up to find itself on the ground.", // 70: Weepinbell
    "用花蜜的香味引诱猎物。 据说被它吞入嘴里的东西，只要1天就会溶解到连骨头都不剩。\u0001The long vine extending from its head is\nwaved about as if it were a living thing to\nattract prey. When an unsuspecting victim\napproaches, it is swallowed whole.", // 71: Victreebel
    "在沙滩等地方晒干后，依然能存活的情况也有很多。 泡在水里的话就会湿润复活。\u0001Its body is almost entirely composed of\nwater. It ensnares its foe with its two\nlong tentacles, then stabs with the poison\nstingers at their tips.", // 72: Tentacool
    "有毒的触手通常是80根。 活得越久，触手的数量就越会减少。\u0001It lives in complex rock formations on\nthe ocean floor and traps prey using its\n80 tentacles. Its red orbs glow when it\ngrows excited or agitated.", // 73: Tentacruel
    "圆圆的很容易拿，但要互相扔的话，又硬又重。 像打雪仗那样扔着玩会很危险。\u0001It climbs mountain paths using only the\npower of its arms. Because they look just\nlike boulders lining paths, hikers may step\non them without noticing.", // 74: Geodude
    "非常喜欢吃长有苔藓的岩石。 发着嘎吱嘎吱的声音，1天吃1吨以上。\u0001They descend from mountains by tumbling\ndown steep slopes. They are so brutal,\nthey smash aside obstructing trees and\nmassive boulders with thunderous tackles.", // 75: Graveler
    "即使用炸药爆破身体也毫发无伤，但非常讨厌湿气和雨。\u0001It is said to live in volcanic craters\non mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds\nits hide and grows larger. The shed hide\ncrumbles and returns to the soil.", // 76: Golem
    "在用力跳跃之后，会 用蹄子和脚上的肌肉 来缓解着地时的撞击。\u0001A PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can\nbarely stand up. Its legs become stronger\nas it stumbles and falls while trying to\nkeep up with its parent.", // 77: Ponyta
    "总之就是喜欢跑步。如果 发现有谁跑得比自己更快，就会用尽全力去追赶。\u0001It usually canters casually in the fields\nand plains. But once a RAPIDASH turns\nserious, its fiery manes flare and blaze\nas it gallops its way up to 150 mph.", // 78: Rapidash
    "长长的尾巴经常被揪断。 因为也不会觉得特别痛，马上会长出来，所以并不在意。\u0001It catches prey by dipping its tail in\nwater at the side of a river. But it often\nforgets what it is doing and spends entire\ndays just loafing at water's edge.", // 79: Slowpoke
    "呆呆地望着大海。 因大舌贝的毒在身体中循环 而变得越来越傻乎乎。\u0001Its tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached\nwith a bite. As a result, the tail can't be\nused for fishing anymore. This forces it\nto reluctantly swim and catch prey.", // 80: Slowbro
    "聚集在有电的地方。 也会密密麻麻地贴在 输送电力的铁塔等地方。\u0001The units at its sides are extremely\npowerful magnets. They generate enough\nmagnetism to draw in iron objects from\nover 300 feet away.", // 81: Magnemite
    "连接的时候，3只小磁怪的 脑袋也会连成一体。 但并不会变得3倍聪明。\u0001It is actually three MAGNEMITE linked\nby magnetism. It generates powerful radio\nwaves that raise temperatures by 3.6\ndegrees F within a 3,300-foot radius.", // 82: Magneton
    "居住在茎状植物生长的地方。 由于这种植物极为稀少而罕见，大葱鸭的数量似乎也在减少。\u0001It is always seen with a stick from a plant.\nApparently, there are good sticks and bad\nsticks. This POKéMON occasionally fights\nwith others over choice sticks.", // 83: Farfetch'd
    "羽毛较短所以不擅长飞行，但是拥有发达的双脚，能够以很快的速度奔跑。\u0001Even while eating or sleeping, one of the\nheads remains always vigilant for any sign\nof danger. When threatened, it flees at\nover 60 miles per hour.", // 84: Doduo
    "由嘟嘟的某个头分裂 出的变种。以60千米的 时速在草原上奔跑。\u0001A peculiar POKéMON species with three\nheads. It vigorously races across grassy\nplains even in arid seasons with little\nrainfall.", // 85: Dodrio
    "人们一直以为它只生活在寒冷的海域。 它出现在阿罗拉的原因是个谜。\u0001SEEL hunt for prey in frigid, ice-covered\nseas. When it needs to breathe, it punches\na hole through the ice with the sharply\nprotruding section of its head.", // 86: Seel
    "能以8节的速度在海里游动，并搜寻能当做猎物的宝可梦。 特别喜欢吃弱丁鱼。\u0001It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice.\nThe sight of this POKéMON sleeping on\na glacier was mistakenly thought to be\na mermaid by a mariner long ago.", // 87: Dewgong
    "工厂排放的污泥废液 是其主要的饵料。 最近数量减少了。\u0001Born from polluted sludge in the sea,\nGRIMER's favorite food is anything filthy.\nThey feed on wastewater pumped out from\nfactories.", // 88: Grimer
    "总之就是臭得鼻子都不敢呼吸。 但是也存在着部分觉得这味道 很不错的臭臭泥爱好者。\u0001It prefers warm and humid habitats.\nIn the summertime, the toxic substances\nin its body intensify, making MUK reek like\nputrid kitchen garbage.", // 89: Muk
    "壳的硬度超过钻石。 过去，人们会收集壳来做成盾牌。\u0001At night, it burrows a hole in the seafloor\nwith its broad tongue to make a place to\nsleep. While asleep, it closes its shell,\nbut leaves its tongue hanging out.", // 90: Shellder
    "坚硬的外壳连燃烧弹也无法击碎。 壳中的正身至今不明。\u0001It swims in the sea by swallowing water,\nthen jetting it out toward the rear.\nThe CLOYSTER shoots spikes from its\nshell using the same system.", // 91: Cloyster
    "如果在已成废墟的 建筑物里亮着怪异的光，说明那里潜藏着鬼斯。\u0001When exposed to a strong wind, a GASTLY's\ngaseous body quickly dwindles away.\nThey cluster under the eaves of houses\nto escape the ravages of wind.", // 92: Gastly
    "从阴暗处袭击人类。 如果被其冰冷的舌头舔到，就会一天天虚弱至死。\u0001If a HAUNTER beckons you while it is\nfloating in darkness, don't approach it.\nThis POKéMON will try to lick you with its\ntongue and steal your life away.", // 93: Haunter
    "如果突然被寒气侵袭，那就是被耿鬼袭击的证据。 没有可逃之法，所以死心吧。\u0001Deep in the night, your shadow cast by\na streetlight may suddenly overtake you.\nIt is actually a GENGAR running past\nyou, pretending to be your shadow.", // 94: Gengar
    "以惊人之势钻地觅食。在它 通过之后形成的洞穴会 被地鼠们当作自己的住处。\u0001There is a magnet in its brain that\nprevents an ONIX from losing direction\nwhile tunneling. As it grows older, its body\nbecomes steadily rounder and smoother.", // 95: Onix
    "吞食梦来生存的宝可梦。 被认为与食梦梦和梦梦蚀 有着共同的祖先。\u0001If your nose becomes itchy while you are\nsleeping, it's a sure sign that a DROWZEE is\nstanding above your pillow and trying to\neat your dream through your nostrils.", // 96: Drowzee
    "是非常危险的宝可梦，但祈求良好睡眠的人们 称其为救世主。\u0001The arcing movement and glitter of the\npendulum in a HYPNO's hand lull the foe\ninto deep hypnosis. While searching for\nprey, it polishes the pendulum.", // 97: Hypno
    "能在海边上找到它。 巨大的钳子即使断掉，今后也会再长出来。\u0001KRABBY live in holes dug into beaches.\nOn sandy shores with little in the way\nof food, they can be seen squabbling with\neach other over territory.", // 98: Krabby
    "一边的钳子很是巨大，虽说硬如钢铁还拥有 1万马力，但还是太重了。\u0001It waves its huge, oversized claw in the\nair to communicate with others.\nBut since the claw is so heavy, this\nPOKéMON quickly tires.", // 99: Kingler
    "据说它与精灵球相似的外形 其实是它的保护色，但它 很容易自爆这一点也出人意料。\u0001It bears an uncanny and unexplained\nresemblance to a POKé BALL. Because it\nexplodes at the slightest shock, even\nveteran TRAINERS treat it with caution.", // 100: Voltorb
    "只要受到一点撞击，就会由于体内的 电能溢出导致爆炸。\u0001They appear in great numbers at electric\npower plants. Because they feed on\nelectricity, they cause massive and\nchaotic blackouts in nearby cities.", // 101: Electrode
    "用心灵感应与伙伴交流。 据说兼有植物与某种别的遗传基因。\u0001It consists of six eggs that care for each\nother. The eggs attract each other and\nspin around. When cracks increasingly\nappear, it is close to evolution.", // 102: Exeggcute
    "各个脑袋里有各自的思想，通过心灵感应来交谈，决定大家要做什么。\u0001Originally from the tropics, EXEGGUTOR's\nheads grow larger from exposure to strong\nsunlight. It is said that when the heads\nfall, they group to form an EXEGGCUTE.", // 103: Exeggutor
    "头上戴着的是死去母亲的 头盖骨。据说，当它摆脱 母亲死亡的悲痛时就会进化。\u0001It pines for the mother it will never see\nagain. Seeing a likeness of its mother in\nthe full moon, it cries. The stains on the\nskull it wears are from its tears.", // 104: Cubone
    "原本因体弱而很胆小。 进化后变成了挥舞着骨头的粗暴性格。\u0001A MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE\nthat has grown tough by overcoming the\ngrief of losing its mother. Its tempered\nand hardened spirit is not easily broken.", // 105: Marowak
    "在踢中敌人的瞬间，脚底会变得像钻石般坚硬，将对手踢成碎片。\u0001Its legs freely stretch and contract.\nUsing these springlike limbs, it bowls over\nfoes with devastating kicks. After battle,\nit rubs down its tired legs.", // 106: Hitmonlee
    "它的拳击好似钻头一般！ 在它的攻击之下，哪怕是 水泥墙也会被钻出洞来。\u0001A HITMONCHAN is said to possess the\nspirit of a boxer who aimed to become the\nworld champion. Having an indomitable\nspirit means that it will never give up.", // 107: Hitmonchan
    "不管是什么，都会用长舌头去舔舔看。 被舔到的部位如果放着不管 就会红肿发炎。\u0001Whenever it sees something unfamiliar,\nit always licks the object because it\nmemorizes things by texture and taste.\nIt is somewhat put off by sour things.", // 108: Lickitung
    "在炎热的地方，它体内的 气体会由于膨胀而产生 爆炸的危险，需要注意。\u0001Getting up close to a KOFFING will give\nyou a chance to observe, through its thin\nskin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It\nblows up at the slightest stimulation.", // 109: Koffing
    "它要靠吸收垃圾 里的毒气、细菌和 灰尘来维持生命。\u0001By diluting its toxic gases with a special\nprocess, the highest grade of perfume can\nbe extracted. To WEEZING, gases emanating\nfrom garbage are the ultimate feast.", // 110: Weezing
    "单细胞的脑子只能思考 一件事情。一旦它开始猛撞，直到睡着前都不会停止。\u0001Once it starts running, it doesn't stop.\nIts tiny brain makes it so stupid that it\ncan't remember why it started running in\nthe first place.", // 111: Rhyhorn
    "可以只用后腿行走，智力也 发达了许多。像盔甲一样的 皮肤可以抵挡住岩浆。\u0001Its horn, which rotates like a drill,\ndestroys tall buildings with one strike.\nIt stands on its hind legs, and its brain\nis well developed.", // 112: Rhydon
    "吉利蛋生下的蛋饱含丰富的营养。 是许多宝可梦非常爱吃的东西。\u0001CHANSEY lay nutritionally excellent eggs\nevery day. The eggs are so delicious, they\nare eagerly devoured by even those people\nwho have lost their appetite.", // 113: Chansey
    "全身被蓝色的蔓藤覆盖，真面目不为人知。据说，它的蔓藤会持续不断地生长。\u0001Its vines snap off easily and painlessly\nif they are grabbed, allowing it to make a\nquick getaway. The lost vines are replaced\nby new growth the very next day.", // 114: Tangela
    "袋兽的母爱很深。 如果是为了守护自己的孩子，据说连死都毫不畏惧。\u0001If you come across a young KANGASKHAN\nplaying by itself, never try to catch it.\nThe baby's parent is sure to be in the area,\nand it will become violently enraged.", // 115: Kangaskhan
    "在感到危险时会从 嘴里用力地喷出水 或者特殊的墨汁。\u0001By cleverly flicking the fins on its back\nside to side, it moves in any direction\nwhile facing forward. It spits ink to\nescape if it senses danger.", // 116: Horsea
    "摸它的背鳍会导致麻痹。 为了避免在睡觉时被水冲走，它会用尾巴缠住珊瑚。\u0001The poisonous barbs all over its body are\nhighly valued as ingredients for making\ntraditional herbal medicine. It shows no\nmercy to anything approaching its nest.", // 117: Seadra
    "天气变得暖和之后，就会成群结队溯流而上。 那画面正如告知春天的风景诗。\u0001In the springtime, schools of GOLDEEN\ncan be seen swimming up falls and rivers.\nIt metes out staggering damage with its\nsingle horn.", // 118: Goldeen
    "凉飕飕的时候，全身就会 晕染成鲜红色。那样子正如 令人感觉到秋意的风景诗。\u0001It punches holes in boulders on stream-\nbeds. This is a clever innovation that\nprevents its eggs from being attacked or\nwashed away by the current.", // 119: Seaking
    "大多在海边栖息。 夜幕降临时，身体的正中 会闪耀出怪异的红色。\u0001It gathers with others in the night and\nmakes its red core glow on and off with\nthe twinkling stars. It can regenerate\nlimbs if they are severed from its body.", // 120: Staryu
    "据说会从闪着光的内核 收发神秘的电波。 靠近的话可能会头痛。\u0001People in ancient times imagined that\nSTARMIE were transformed from the\nreflections of stars that twinkled on\ngentle waves at night.", // 121: Starmie
    "有着非凡的默剧表演实力。 在你看入迷的时候，不知不觉间 就会出现一面真正的墙壁。\u0001A MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. It can\nconvince others that something unseeable\nactually exists. Once believed, the\nimaginary object does become real.", // 122: Mr. Mime
    "以忍者般敏捷的动作令猎物感到迷惑。 然后趁对方麻痹大意的一瞬间 用镰刀将其切碎。\u0001Its blindingly fast speed adds to the\nsharpness of its twin forearm scythes.\nThe scythes can slice through thick logs\nin one wicked stroke.", // 123: Scyther
    "会按独特的节奏扭动腰部。 栖息在阿罗拉的迷唇姐，那动作更是妙不可言。\u0001A JYNX sashays rhythmically as if it were\ndancing. Its motions are so bouncingly\nalluring, people seeing it are compelled to\nshake their hips without noticing.", // 124: Jynx
    "突发的停电，有一半 是因为电击兽聚集在发电厂 胡乱吞食电力造成的。\u0001When a storm approaches, it competes with\nothers to scale heights that are likely to\nbe stricken by lightning. Some towns use\nELECTABUZZ in place of lightning rods.", // 125: Electabuzz
    "感到疲劳时就跳入火山口，浸泡在熔岩中让身体解乏。 全身以1200度燃烧着。\u0001In battle, it blows out intense flames from\nall over its body to intimidate its foe.\nThese fiery bursts create heat waves that\nignite grass and trees in the area.", // 126: Magmar
    "用长长的角把对手夹住，就这么把对方夹成两半。 非常强大，但很害怕寒冷。\u0001Their pincers are strong enough to\nshatter thick logs. Because they dislike\ncold, PINSIR burrow and sleep under\nthe ground on chilly nights.", // 127: Pinsir
    "在世界各地都有骑着肯泰罗 生活的历史，但这一切的开端 据说是在阿罗拉。\u0001It is not satisfied unless it is rampaging\nat all times. If there is no opponent for\nTAUROS to battle, it will charge at thick\ntrees and knock them down to calm itself.", // 128: Tauros
    "力量很弱，派不上用场，但就只有繁殖力惊人。 多得简直要看腻了。\u0001Its swimming muscles are weak, so it is\neasily washed away by currents. In places\nwhere water pools, you can see many\nMAGIKARP deposited there by the flow.", // 129: Magikarp
    "据说，让暴鲤龙怒火中烧的 某个街镇在一晚上就被燃烧殆尽，然后便消失无踪了。\u0001It is an extremely vicious and violent\nPOKéMON. When humans begin to fight,\nit will appear and burn everything to the\nground with intensely hot flames.", // 130: Gyarados
    "拥有很高的智商，理解人类的语言。 心情好的时候会用美妙的声音唱歌。\u0001People have driven LAPRAS almost to the\npoint of extinction. In the evenings,\nit is said to sing plaintively as it seeks\nwhat few others of its kind still remain.", // 131: Lapras
    "通过重组细胞让自己样子变得 和眼前的对手一模一样。 相似度依个体而有所不同。\u0001A DITTO rearranges its cell structure to\ntransform itself. However, if it tries to\nchange based on its memory, it will get\ndetails wrong.", // 132: Ditto
    "拥有不平衡性外加不稳定的 遗传基因，因而蕴含着各种 各样的进化可能性。\u0001An EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup\nthat suddenly mutates due to its\nenvironment. Radiation from various\nSTONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.", // 133: Eevee
    "细胞构造与水分子非常相似。 在水边栖息，所以有时候 会被错认为是人鱼。\u0001VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous\nmutation and grew fins and gills that\nallow them to live underwater. They have\nthe ability to freely control water.", // 134: Vaporeon
    "喷出大约10000伏特的电力。 因为相当神经质，所以要与它 变得亲密是非常困难的。\u0001Its cells generate weak power that is\namplified by its fur's static electricity\nto drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is\nmade of electrically charged needles.", // 135: Jolteon
    "如果寻获树果或是捉到猎物，就会喷出火焰将其烤至完全熟透，之后大口大口吃掉。\u0001FLAREON's fluffy fur releases heat into\nthe air so that its body does not get\nexcessively hot. Its body temperature can\nrise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.", // 136: Flareon
    "大约20年前，集当时的科学力量于一身，创造出来的人工宝可梦。\u0001It is capable of reverting itself entirely\nback to program data in order to enter\ncyberspace. A PORYGON is copy-\nprotected so it cannot be duplicated.", // 137: Porygon
    "生活在古代海洋中的宝可梦。 好像曾是始祖大鸟的食物，发现过带有齿痕的化石。\u0001One of the ancient and long-since-extinct\nPOKéMON that have been regenerated\nfrom fossils by humans. If attacked,\nit withdraws into its hard shell.", // 138: Omanyte
    "被认为是由于身上沉重的壳 而灭绝的古代宝可梦。 好像是章鱼桶的远祖。\u0001An OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture\nits prey. It is believed to have become\nextinct because its shell grew too large,\nmaking its movements slow and ponderous.", // 139: Omastar
    "3亿年前繁衍兴旺的宝可梦。 据说在某些地区，至今仍能 偶尔看见活着的化石盔。\u0001It is a POKéMON that has been regenerated\nfrom a fossil. However, in rare cases, living\nexamples have been discovered. KABUTO\nhave not changed for 300 million years.", // 140: Kabuto
    "为了在陆地上也能活动，身体开始了演化，但没等演化完，它就灭绝了。\u0001KABUTOPS once swam underwater to hunt \nfor prey. It was apparently evolving from\nbeing a water dweller to living on land as\nevident from changes in its gills and legs.", // 141: Kabutops
    "恐龙时代的宝可梦。 用锯子一样的牙齿 将猎物撕碎后吞食。\u0001AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age\nof dinosaurs. It was regenerated from DNA\nextracted from amber. It is imagined to\nhave been the king of the skies.", // 142: Aerodactyl
    "据说拥有最强的胃袋。 就连臭臭泥的毒对卡比兽的 舌头来说也只是调味料而已。\u0001SNORLAX's typical day consists of nothing\nmore than eating and sleeping. It is such\na docile POKéMON that there are children\nwho use its big belly as a place to play.", // 143: Snorlax
    "传说的鸟宝可梦。它能将 冬日空中的空气中含有的 水分冻结，降下雪花。\u0001ARTICUNO is a legendary bird POKéMON that\ncan control ice. The flapping of its wings\nchills the air. As a result, it is said that\nwhen this POKéMON flies, snow will fall.", // 144: Articuno
    "当天空黑暗，落雷 不断时，这只传说的 宝可梦就会出现。\u0001ZAPDOS is a legendary bird POKéMON that\nhas the ability to control electricity.\nIt usually lives in thunderclouds. It gains\npower if it is stricken by lightning bolts.", // 145: Zapdos
    "传说的鸟宝可梦。当它 挥舞起剧烈燃烧着的双翅，哪怕是夜空也会被点亮。\u0001MOLTRES is a legendary bird POKéMON\nthat can control fire. If injured, it is said\nto dip its body in the molten magma of\na volcano to burn and heal itself.", // 146: Moltres
    "通过反复蜕皮一点点长大。 将蜕下的皮鞣制后做成的 靴子是超高级商品。\u0001A DRATINI continually molts and sloughs\noff its old skin. It does so because the\nlife energy within its body steadily builds\nto reach uncontrollable levels.", // 147: Dratini
    "据说，在水晶般的珠子里 蕴含着操纵天气的力量。\u0001A DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of\nenergy inside its body. It is said to alter\nthe weather around it by loosing energy\nfrom the crystals on its neck and tail.", // 148: Dragonair
    "遇难得救的男人 被带去的那个孤岛，是曾属于快龙的乐园。\u0001It can circle the globe in just 16 hours.\nIt is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads\nlost and foundering ships in a storm\nto the safety of land.", // 149: Dragonite
    "超梦的基因几乎和梦幻 完全一样，但是大小和 性格却迥异得让人吃惊。\u0001A POKéMON that was created by genetic\nmanipulation. However, even though the\nscientific power of humans made its body,\nthey failed to give it a warm heart.", // 150: Mewtwo
    "用显微镜可以看到 它身上极短极细 且密集的体毛。\u0001A MEW is said to possess the genes of all\nPOKéMON. It is capable of making itself\ninvisible at will, so it entirely avoids\nnotice even if it approaches people.", // 151: Mew
    "它会用头上的叶子来判断温度和湿度。它很喜欢晒太阳。\u0001It waves its leaf around to keep foes\nat bay. However, a sweet fragrance also\nwafts from the leaf, creating a friendly\natmosphere that becalms the battlers.", // 152: Chikorita
    "香料般的香气从它脖子周围散发出来。不知为何，闻了这香气就会让人想要战斗。\u0001A BAYLEEF's neck is ringed by curled-up\nleaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree\nshoot. The fragrance of this shoot\nmakes people peppy.", // 153: Bayleef
    "从它花瓣散发出的香气中含有一种能平复攻击性情绪的物质。\u0001The fragrance of a MEGANIUM's flower\nsoothes and calms emotions. In battle,\nit gives off more of its becalming scent\nto blunt the foe's fighting spirit.", // 154: Meganium
    "它生性胆小，总是把自己蜷成一团。如果受到攻击，它会点燃背上的火焰来保护自己。\u0001It flares flames from its back to protect\nitself. The fire burns vigorously if the\nPOKéMON is angry. When it is tired,\nit sputters with incomplete combustion.", // 155: Cyndaquil
    "战斗中如果它转过身去，你可要小心了。这意味着它要用背上的火焰发动攻击。\u0001It intimidates foes with intense gusts of\nflames and superheated air. Its quick\nnimbleness lets it dodge attacks even\nwhile scorching an enemy.", // 156: Quilava
    "如果它的愤怒达到顶峰，它会变得极其炽热，任何触碰它的东西都会瞬间燃烧起来。\u0001It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze\nthat it creates using its intense flames.\nTYPHLOSION create blazing explosive\nblasts that burn everything to cinders.", // 157: Typhlosion
    "它那发达的下颚力量强大，能咬碎任何东西。就连训练家也必须小心。\u0001Despite its small body, TOTODILE's jaws\nare very powerful. While it may think it is\njust playfully nipping, its bite has enough\nstrength to cause serious injury.", // 158: Totodile
    "如果它掉了一颗獠牙，新的会立刻在原处长出来。它的嘴里总是排列着48颗獠牙。\u0001Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will\nabsolutely not let go. Because the tips of\nits fangs are forked back like fishhooks,\nthey become irremovably embedded.", // 159: Croconaw
    "当它用巨大而有力的下颚咬住猎物时，它会甩动头部，野蛮地将猎物撕碎。\u0001It opens its huge mouth to intimidate\nenemies. In battle, it runs using its thick\nand powerful hind legs to charge the\nfoe with incredible speed.", // 160: Feraligatr
    "它会筑一个适合自己细长身体的巢穴。这个巢穴其他宝可梦根本无法进入。\u0001They take turns standing guard when it\nis time to sleep. The sentry awakens the\nothers if it senses danger. If one becomes\nseparated, it turns sleepless with fear.", // 161: Sentret
    "它会筑巢以适应自己细长的身体。这个巢穴其他宝可梦无法进入。\u0001A FURRET has a very slim build. When under\nattack, it can squirm through narrow\nspaces and get away. In spite of its short\nlimbs, it is very nimble and fleet.", // 162: Furret
    "每天必定会按固定的节奏倾斜脖子。 过去人们会养它来代替时钟。\u0001It has an internal organ that senses\nthe earth's rotation. Using this special\norgan, a HOOTHOOT begins hooting at\nprecisely the same time every day.", // 163: Hoothoot
    "即便是在黑暗里，它的眼睛也能 看得一清二楚，不会放过任何猎物。 所以也被称为黑夜帝王。\u0001It unfailingly catches prey in darkness.\nNOCTOWL owe their success to superior\nvision that allows them to see in minimal\nlight, and to their supple and silent wings.", // 164: Noctowl
    "因为胆小，不总是聚在一起 就会感到不安。背后的花纹 每只都会有细微的不同。\u0001LEDYBA communicate using a fluid that\nthey secrete from where the legs join the\nbody. They are said to convey feelings to\nothers by altering the fluid's scent.", // 165: Ledyba
    "据说星光是它的能量，但平时也非常喜爱吃树果。 白天就用草包裹着睡觉。\u0001It is said that in lands with clean air,\nwhere the stars fill the sky, there live\nmany LEDIAN. For good reason, they use\nthe light of the stars as energy.", // 166: Ledian
    "一心一意地等着，直到爱吃的萌虻落入巢中。 实在是有耐心的宝可梦。\u0001The web it spins can be considered its\nsecond nervous system. It is said that a\nSPINARAK determines its prey by the tiny\nvibrations it feels through the web.", // 167: Spinarak
    "也有地区会使用 阿利多斯的丝来织布。 因布料结实而广受好评。\u0001Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws\nthat enable it to scuttle on ceilings and\nvertical walls. It constricts its foe with\nthin and strong silk webbing.", // 168: Ariados
    "用4根翅膀又快又静地飞行。 在被发现之前一口咬住猎物。 一瞬间就把血都吸掉。\u0001Over the course of evolution, its hind legs\nturned into wings. By alternately resting\nits front and rear wings, it can fly all day\nwithout having to stop.", // 169: Crobat
    "2根触手原本是鳍。 释放电力让猎物麻痹后进行袭击。\u0001When it senses danger, it discharges\npositive and negative electricity from its\ntwo antennae. It lives in depths beyond\nsunlight's reach.", // 170: Chinchou
    "探头望向夜晚的海面，如果看到犹如闪烁的星星 一样的光，那是电灯怪哦。\u0001The light-emitting orbs on its back are\nvery bright. They are formed from a part of\nits dorsal fin. This POKéMON illuminates\nthe inky darkness of deep seas.", // 171: Lanturn
    "运用电的水平还不够。 稍不留神就被自己的电 麻到也时有发生。\u0001It is still inept at retaining electricity.\nWhen it is startled, it discharges power\naccidentally. It gets better at holding\npower as it grows older.", // 172: Pichu
    "在流星闪耀的深夜里 凝望着天空的样子，似乎是在怀念故乡。\u0001On nights with many shooting stars,\nCLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring.\nThey dance until daybreak, when they\nquench their thirst with the morning dew.", // 173: Cleffa
    "喜欢唱歌，但还不怎么在行。 如果能给予恰当的表扬，就会渐渐有所提高哦。\u0001Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy.\nWhen it sings continuously with all its\nmight, its body steadily turns a deepening\npink color.", // 174: Igglybuff
    "壳内好像塞满了很多幸福，据说如果能温柔对待它，它就会把幸运分给对方。\u0001As its energy, it uses the feelings of\ncompassion and pleasure exuded by\npeople and POKéMON. It stores up happy\nfeelings in its shell, then shares them out.", // 175: Togepi
    "据说它是为了将幸福带给 性格温柔的人而现身的。\u0001It is said to be a POKéMON that brings good\nfortune. When it spots someone who is pure\nof heart, a TOGETIC appears and shares its\nhappiness with that person.", // 176: Togetic
    "虽然还无法飞行，但跳跃力超群。 能跳上很高的树枝啄食树芽。\u0001It runs up short trees that grow on the\nsavanna to peck at new shoots.\nA NATU's eyes look as if they are\nalways observing something.", // 177: Natu
    "据说该宝可梦虽然有着 能预知未来的力量，但却没有能改变未来的力量。\u0001It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing\nthe future. Some people in different lands\nhave long believed that XATU are\nemissaries from another world.", // 178: Xatu
    "用咩利羊的毛制成的 衣服容易起静电，所以会做特殊加工。\u0001Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds\na static charge. The more energy is\ncharged, the more brightly the lightbulb\nat the tip of its tail glows.", // 179: Mareep
    "毛发不生有如橡胶一样的 皮肤不会导电，即便触电了也很安全。\u0001Its fleece quality changes to generate\nstrong static electricity with a small\namount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its\nhide are shielded against electricity.", // 180: Flaaffy
    "尾巴上的光能传至宇宙，所以身在何处一目了然。 因此它平时不会让尾巴发光。\u0001It gives off so much light that it can be\nseen even from space. People in the old\ndays used its light to send signals back\nand forth with others far away.", // 181: Ampharos
    "在南国大量生活着。 跳舞时花瓣会互相碰触，发出悦耳的声音。\u0001Its flower petals deepen in color through\nexposure to sunlight. When cloudy weather\npersists, it does a dance that is thought\nto be a ritual for summoning the sun.", // 182: Bellossom
    "圆圆的尾巴拥有 救生圈的功能。球里满是 转变为了油脂的营养。\u0001Its body is covered with water-repellent\nfur. Because of the fur, it can swim\nthrough water at high speed without being\nslowed by the water's resistance.", // 183: Marill
    "一天大部分的时间都在 水中度过。天晴时会 浮到水面上晒太阳。\u0001It lives in water virtually all day long.\nIts body color and pattern act as\ncamouflage that makes it tough for\nenemies to spot in water.", // 184: Azumarill
    "为了不被袭击而模仿成树木的样子，但如果被讨厌的水泼到，就会慌慌张张地逃走。\u0001It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked\nby enemies. But since its forelegs\nremain green throughout the year, it is\neasily identified as a fake in the winter.", // 185: Sudowoodo
    "在有月亮的夜晚聚集起来大合唱。 那鸣叫声如怒吼般，并不美妙，但却别有韵味。\u0001The curled hair on its head proves its\nstatus as a king. It is said that the\nlonger and curlier the hair, the more\nrespect it earns from its peers.", // 186: Politoed
    "为了不被风吹走，它们会聚集成群。不过它们倒是很喜欢轻柔的微风。\u0001This POKéMON drifts and floats with the\nwind. If it senses the approach of strong\nwinds, a HOPPIP links leaves with others\nto prepare against being blown away.", // 187: Hoppip
    "它头顶的花朵会随着温度的升降而开合。\u0001It blossoms when the temperature rises\nabove 64 degrees F. Because its flower's\nblooming changes with the temperature,\nit is sometimes used as a thermometer.", // 188: Skiploom
    "它随着季风飘荡，环游世界，一路播撒棉孢子。\u0001JUMPLUFF ride warm southern winds to\ncross the sea and fly to foreign lands.\nThis POKéMON lands when it encounters\ncold air while it is floating.", // 189: Jumpluff
    "习惯用尾巴做各种事情后，手就变得不怎么灵活了。 会在很高的树上筑巢。\u0001Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike\nappendage. However, because it uses the\ntail so much, AIPOM's real hands have\nbecome rather clumsy.", // 190: Aipom
    "它有时会突然从天上掉下来。如果被烈雀攻击，它会猛烈地摇晃叶子。\u0001SUNKERN try to minimize movement to\nconserve the nutrients they have stored\nin their bodies for evolution. They will\nnot eat, subsisting only on morning dew.", // 191: Sunkern
    "它能把阳光转化为能量。在日落后的一片黑暗中，它会合拢花瓣，静止不动。\u0001SUNFLORA convert solar energy into\nnutrition. They are highly active in the\nwarm daytime but suddenly stop moving as\nsoon as the sun sets.", // 192: Sunflora
    "如果它极速扇动翅膀，就能产生足以震碎周围窗户的冲击波。\u0001It can see 360 degrees without moving\nits eyes. It is a great flier capable of\nmaking sudden stops and turning midair to\nquickly chase down targeted prey.", // 193: Yanma
    "在冰冷的水中生活。 附近天气变凉之后，也会来到地上觅食。\u0001WOOPER usually live in water but come\nout onto land seeking food occasionally.\nOn land, they coat their bodies with a\ngooey, toxic film.", // 194: Wooper
    "就算脑袋撞上船底或河里的岩石，也完全不会去在意，悠然自在地 游泳的悠闲宝可梦。\u0001A QUAGSIRE hunts by leaving its mouth wide\nopen in water and waiting for its prey to\nblunder in. Because it doesn't move, it\ndoes not get very hungry.", // 195: Quagsire
    "利用又细又短的体毛，从空气的流动中，连对手的行动 也能一瞬间就察觉。\u0001An ESPEON is extremely loyal to any\nTRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is\nsaid to have developed precognitive\npowers to protect its TRAINER from harm.", // 196: Espeon
    "发怒的时候会从全身的毛孔里 喷出混合了毒素的汗液，袭击对手的眼睛。\u0001UMBREON evolved from exposure to the\nmoon's energy pulses. It lurks in darkness\nand waits for its foes to move. The rings\non its body glow when it leaps to attack.", // 197: Umbreon
    "日落时醒来，夜晚飞行。 也有俗话说，黑暗鸦出窝，赶紧要回家。\u0001MURKROW were feared as the alleged\nbearers of ill fortune. It shows strong\ninterest in anything that sparkles. It will\neven try to steal rings from women.", // 198: Murkrow
    "受被咬到的毒素影响，拥有天才的头脑。 能自由自在地操纵精神力量。\u0001It undertakes research every day to\nsolve the mysteries of the world.\nHowever, it apparently forgets everything\nif the SHELLDER on its head comes off.", // 199: Slowking
    "千方百计地吓唬人类，吸取生命的能量。 吓人的练习一天也不落。\u0001A MISDREAVUS frightens people with a\ncreepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses\nits red spheres to absorb the fear of foes\nas its nutrition.", // 200: Misdreavus
    "它们的形状看起来像古代石板上的象形文字。据说两者之间有着某种关联。\u0001This POKéMON is shaped like ancient text\ncharacters. Although research is ongoing,\nit is a mystery as to which came first,\nthe ancient writings or the various UNOWN.", // 201: Unown
    "讨厌光和冲击。 受到攻击时，身体就会膨胀，反击也会因此变强。\u0001Usually docile, a WOBBUFFET strikes back\nferociously if its black tail is attacked.\nIt makes its lair in caves where it waits\nfor nightfall.", // 202: Wobbuffet
    "它的尾巴里有一个独立的小脑袋。当心！如果你靠得太近，它可能会闻到你的气味而咬你。\u0001A GIRAFARIG is an herbivore--it eats\ngrass and tree shoots. While it is eating,\nits tail makes chewing and swallowing\nmotions as if it were also eating.", // 203: Girafarig
    "会挂在树上静静等待作为 它猎物的虫宝可梦送上门来。 在阿罗拉，它喜欢吃的是萌虻。\u0001A PINECO hangs from a tree branch and\nwaits for prey. While eating, if it is\ndisturbed by someone shaking its tree, it\nfalls on the ground and suddenly explodes.", // 204: Pineco
    "只要一有东西靠近，它就会射出 钢铁外壳的碎片进行攻击。 这是一种无意识的条件反射。\u0001It keeps itself inside its steel shell.\nThe shell is opened when it is catching\nprey, but it is so quick that the shell's\ninside cannot be seen.", // 205: Forretress
    "能挖掘地面移动。 会友好地和地鼠共用各自的隧道。\u0001Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into\nthe ground backwards. This POKéMON is\nknown to make its nest in complex shapes\ndeep under the ground.", // 206: Dunsparce
    "它会径直飞向目标的脸部，然后钳住受惊的猎物注入毒素。\u0001It glides without making a single sound.\nIt grasps the face of its foe using its\nhind and large front claws, then stabs\nwith its poison barb.", // 207: Gligar
    "据说当大岩蛇活到了 100年以上，身体的成分 就会变得如同钻石一般。\u0001STEELIX live even further underground\nthan ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig\ntoward the earth's core, reaching a depth\nof over six-tenths of a mile underground.", // 208: Steelix
    "脸很严厉，但其实相当胆小。 拼命威吓的表情在女性中很有人气。\u0001By baring its fangs and making a scary\nface, it sends smaller POKéMON scurrying\nin terror. The SNUBBULL does seem a\nlittle sad at making its foes flee.", // 209: Snubbull
    "发达的下颚和沉重的牙齿 是它的武器。只要不惹怒它，很少会被咬到哦。\u0001It has a particularly well-developed lower\njaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing\nit to tilt its head. Unless it is startled, it\nwill not try to bite.", // 210: Granbull
    "对手的体型越是巨大，它就会 喝下越多的水使身体膨胀，仿佛马上就要破裂一般。\u0001A QWILFISH uses the pressure of water\nit swallows to shoot toxic quills all at\nonce from all over its body. It finds\nswimming to be somewhat challenging.", // 211: Qwilfish
    "为了防止战斗时变得过热，而令金属的身体熔化，会使用翅膀调节体温。\u0001A SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of\nsteel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary\nsorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to\nregulate its body temperature.", // 212: Scizor
    "甲壳里储存着树果。 为了避免受到袭击，它会一动不动地躲在岩石下面。\u0001A SHUCKLE hides under rocks, keeping its\nbody concealed inside its shell while\neating stored berries. The berries mix with\nits body fluids to become a juice.", // 213: Shuckle
    "粗粗的角是其骄傲。 在阿罗拉，锹农炮虫是它最大的 竞争者，双方经常大打出手。\u0001They gather in forests seeking the sweet\nsap of trees. It is completely clad in a\nsteel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn,\nwhich it uses to fling foes.", // 214: Heracross
    "狡黠凶恶的性格。 趁着双亲不在就侵入巢穴，将蛋盗出。\u0001A SNEASEL scales trees by punching its\nhooked claws into the bark. It seeks out\nunguarded nests and steals eggs for food\nwhile the parents are away.", // 215: Sneasel
    "如果发现蜂蜜，它眉间的月牙形印记就会发光。它总舔爪子，因为上面沾满了蜂蜜。\u0001It licks its palms that are sweetened by\nbeing soaked in honey. A TEDDIURSA makes\nits own honey by blending fruits and pollen\ncollected by BEEDRILL.", // 216: Teddiursa
    "虽然它很擅长爬树，但它更喜欢用前肢折断树干，吃落在地上的树果。\u0001In forests, it is said that there are many\nstreams and towering trees where an\nURSARING gathers food. It walks through\nits forest collecting food every day.", // 217: Ursaring
    "它的身体由岩浆构成。如果不持续移动，身体就会冷却变硬。\u0001It is a species of POKéMON that lives in\nvolcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin\nhardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that,\nit sleeps near magma.", // 218: Slugma
    "背上的壳只是皮肤冷却硬化形成的。轻轻一碰就会碎裂。\u0001The shell on its back is made of hardened\nmagma. Tens of thousands of years spent\nliving in volcanic craters have turned\nMAGCARGO's bodies into magma.", // 219: Magcargo
    "为了寻找食物，会用鼻子摩擦地面并进行挖掘。 偶尔会挖到温泉。\u0001It roots for food by rubbing its snout\nagainst the ground. Its favorite food is a\nmushroom that grows under dried grass.\nIt occasionally roots out hot springs.", // 220: Swinub
    "朝着对手冲过去时，背上的体毛会倒竖起来。 对声音极度敏感。\u0001A PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat\nof long hair for enduring freezing cold.\nIt uses its tusks to dig up food that has\nbeen buried under ice.", // 221: Piloswine
    "头顶上长着珊瑚枝。 虽然相当容易折断，但大约3天就能恢复哦。\u0001CORSOLA live in warm southern seas.\nIf the sea becomes polluted, the beautiful\ncoral stalks become discolored and crumble\naway in tatters.", // 222: Corsola
    "会粘在巨翅飞鱼身上，吃一点残羹剩饭。如果巨翅飞鱼 受到袭击，它就会与其一同战斗。\u0001A REMORAID uses its abdominal muscles\nto forcefully expel swallowed water, then\nshoot down flying prey. When evolution\napproaches, it travels down rivers.", // 223: Remoraid
    "逃跑时吐出来的墨汁很特别。 里面有着能让嗅觉变迟钝的成分，连鼻子灵敏的宝可梦也能迷惑。\u0001It ensnares its foe with its suction-\ncupped tentacles before delivering the\nfinishing blow. If the foe turns out to be\ntoo strong, it spews ink to escape.", // 224: Octillery
    "原本很喜欢寒冷的地方，但是阿罗拉的信使鸟好像 即便是有点儿炎热也能忍耐。\u0001It carries food bundled up in its tail.\nThere was a famous explorer who\nmanaged to scale Mt. Everest thanks\nto a DELIBIRD sharing its food.", // 225: Delibird
    "阿罗拉的人气特产是绘有巨翅飞鱼 在海浪上优雅跳跃的明信片及海报。\u0001On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be\nseen elegantly leaping over the waves.\nIt is not bothered by the REMORAID that\nhitches rides.", // 226: Mantine
    "由于它身上掉落下来的羽毛 可以用来制剑，因此作为纹章 的图案也很有人气。\u0001A POKéMON that has a body and wings of\nsteel. People in the past used feathers\nfallen from SKARMORY to make swords and\nknives.", // 227: Skarmory
    "擅长与伙伴的合作。 如果成为同伴，就会非常听从训练家的命令。\u0001HOUNDOUR communicate with each other\nusing a variety of cries to corner their\nprey. This POKéMON's remarkable teamwork\nis simply unparalleled.", // 228: Houndour
    "能喷出混有毒素的火焰结果对手。 会和群体中的成员平分猎物。\u0001In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns\nraked sharply back serves a leadership\nrole. They choose their leader by fighting\namong themselves.", // 229: Houndoom
    "会在暴风雨袭来时出现在 海面上。如果遇到快龙，便会开始激烈的争斗。\u0001It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor.\nWhen it comes up to the surface, it\ncreates a huge whirlpool that can swallow\neven ships.", // 230: Kingdra
    "它喜欢甩动长鼻子玩耍，但因为力气太大，这样可能会很危险。\u0001PHANPY's big ears serve as broad fans.\nWhen it becomes hot, it flaps the ears\nbusily to cool down. Even the young are\nvery strong.", // 231: Phanpy
    "它拥有锋利坚硬的獠牙和粗糙的皮肤。它的撞击强到足以撞倒一栋房子。\u0001A DONPHAN is so strong it can easily haul\na dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a\nrock-hard state. An ordinary sort of\nattack won't even leave a scratch.", // 232: Donphan
    "将行星的开发纳入视野，以当时的最新技术升级了多边兽。\u0001It was created by humans using the power\nof science. It has been given artificial\nintelligence that enables it to learn new\ngestures and emotions on its own.", // 233: Porygon2
    "它弯曲的犄角能微妙地改变气流，创造出扭曲现实的奇异空间。\u0001STANTLER's magnificent antlers were\nonce traded at high prices as works of art.\nAs a result, this POKéMON was hunted\nclose to extinction.", // 234: Stantler
    "用从尾巴尖尖慢慢渗出的 体液绘出独有的标记，宣告自己的领地。\u0001A SMEARGLE marks its territory using a\nfluid that leaks out from the tip of its\ntail. About 5,000 different marks left by\nthis POKéMON have been found.", // 235: Smeargle
    "永远都是精力充沛的样子。 为了变强，就算输了一次又一次，也会不断地站起来迎战对手。\u0001TYROGUE become stressed out if they do\nnot get to train every day. When raising\nthis POKéMON, the TRAINER must establish\na regular training schedule.", // 236: Tyrogue
    "会旋转身体使出踢击。 当它高速旋转身体时，会直接钻进地底下。\u0001Its technique of kicking while spinning is\na remarkable mix of both offense and\ndefense. HITMONTOP travel faster\nspinning than they do walking.", // 237: Hitmontop
    "在确认某样东西时，会先用嘴唇而不是手去触碰试试。 会经常用舌头舔去污渍。\u0001It actively runs about, but also falls\noften. Whenever it falls, it will check its\nreflection on a lake's surface to make\nsure its face hasn't become dirty.", // 238: Smoochum
    "在家的时候，插座就相当于奶瓶。 可以从中滋滋地吸取电力哦。\u0001If it touches metal and discharges the\nelectricity it has stored in its body, an\nELEKID begins swinging its arms in circles\nto recharge itself.", // 239: Elekid
    "在火山地带经常能见到。 如果冒失地给了它食物的话会很高兴，激动地喷出600度的火。\u0001If a MAGBY is spouting yellow flames from\nits mouth, it is in good health. When it is\nfatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with\nthe flames.", // 240: Magby
    "这款牛奶营养丰富且热量很高。 所以饮用过量的话 就会变成大奶罐那样的体型。\u0001It gives over five gallons of milk daily.\nIts sweet milk is enjoyed by children and\ngrown-ups alike. People who can't drink\nmilk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.", // 241: Miltank
    "如果吃了据说饱含着幸福的 幸福蛋的蛋，无论怎么 残暴的宝可梦都会变得温和。\u0001If it senses sadness with its fluffy fur,\na BLISSEY will rush over to the sad person,\nhowever far away, to share an egg of\nhappiness that brings a smile to any face.", // 242: Blissey
    "它携带的雨云让它能随意发射雷电。据说它是伴随着闪电降临的。\u0001RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning.\nIts roars send shock waves shuddering\nthrough the air and ground as if\nlightning bolts were crashing down.", // 243: Raikou
    "它吼叫时火山就会喷发。由于无法抑制自身极端的力量，它在陆地上四处狂奔。\u0001ENTEI embodies the passion of magma.\nIt is thought to have been born in the\neruption of a volcano. It blasts fire that\nconsumes all that it touches.", // 244: Entei
    "据说是北风的转世，能瞬间净化污浊浑浊的水。\u0001SUICUNE embodies the compassion of\na pure spring of water. It runs across\nthe land with gliding elegance. It has the\npower to purify dirty water.", // 245: Suicune
    "诞生于地下，会一边吃着泥土，一边朝至亲所在的地面前进。 因为光线刺眼，所以它不太能适应哦。\u0001A LARVITAR is born deep under the ground.\nIt must eat its way through the soil above\nand reach the surface for it to see its\nparents' faces.", // 246: Larvitar
    "它是令人头痛的宝可梦。 不等进化完成就会利用压缩气体 四处乱飞大闹来纾解压力。\u0001A PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body\nthat it ejects under compression to propel\nitself like a jet. Its body can withstand\na collision with solid steel.", // 247: Pupitar
    "会在山中徘徊以寻求战斗对手。 但如果遇到的是比自己弱小的对手，它就会视若无睹地离开。\u0001A TYRANITAR is so overwhelmingly powerful,\nit can bring down a whole mountain to make\nits nest. It roams in mountains seeking\nnew opponents to fight.", // 248: Tyranitar
    "据说因为力量过于强大，它安静地在深海底部度过时光。\u0001LUGIA is so powerful even a light\nfluttering of its wings can blow apart\nhouses. As a result, it chooses to live out\nof sight deep under the sea.", // 249: Lugia
    "传说这只宝可梦用其绚丽的七彩翅膀，不停地翱翔于世界的天空。\u0001Its feathers--which glow in seven colors\ndepending on the angle at which they are\nstruck by light--are thought to bring joy.\nIt is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.", // 250: Ho-Oh
    "拥有能够穿越时光的力量。 在许多时代都留下了 将它视为森林之神的记录。\u0001This POKéMON came from the future by\ncrossing over time. It is thought that so\nlong as CELEBI appears, a bright and\nshining future awaits us.", // 251: Celebi
    "木守宫的脚底有小钩子，能让它攀爬垂直的墙壁。这只宝可梦会用粗壮的尾巴猛击对手来攻击。\u0001It makes its nest in a giant tree in the\nforest. It ferociously guards against\nanything nearing its territory. It is said\nto be the protector of the forest's trees.", // 252: Treecko
    "森林蜥蜴身上长出的叶子便于它在森林中躲避敌人。这只宝可梦是丛林爬树的高手。\u0001Leaves grow out of this POKéMON's body.\nThey help obscure a GROVYLE from the eyes\nof its enemies while it is in a thickly\novergrown forest.", // 253: Grovyle
    "蜥蜴王身上长出的叶子边缘非常锋利。这只宝可梦极其敏捷——它能在树枝间跳跃，并从上方或背后扑向对手。\u0001In the jungle, its power is without equal.\nThis POKéMON carefully grows trees and\nplants. It regulates its body temperature\nby basking in sunlight.", // 254: Sceptile
    "火稚鸡会跟在训练家身后，迈着不稳的步伐。这只宝可梦能喷出超过1800华氏度的火焰，包括将对手烧得焦黑的火球。\u0001If attacked, it strikes back by spitting\nballs of fire it forms in its stomach.\nA TORCHIC dislikes darkness because it\ncan't see its surroundings.", // 255: Torchic
    "力壮鸡通过在田野和山间奔跑来锻炼腿部和大腿。这只宝可梦的双腿兼具速度与力量，能在一秒内踢出十脚。\u0001It lashes out with 10 kicks per second.\nIts strong fighting instinct compels it\nto keep up its offensive until the\nopponent gives up.", // 256: Combusken
    "火焰从它的手腕喷出，包裹住指关节。它的拳头能将对手灼伤。\u0001It learns martial arts that use punches\nand kicks. Every several years, its old\nfeathers burn off, and new, supple\nfeathers grow back in their place.", // 257: Blaziken
    "水跃鱼头上的鳍充当着高度灵敏的雷达。通过用这个鳍感知水和空气的流动，这只宝可梦不用眼睛就能判断周围发生的事。\u0001On land, it can powerfully lift large\nboulders by planting its four feet and\nheaving. It sleeps by burying itself in soil\nat the water's edge.", // 258: Mudkip
    "沼跃鱼的身体表面覆盖着一层薄薄的粘性薄膜，使它能在陆地上生存。这只宝可梦会在退潮时在海滩的泥巴里玩耍。\u0001Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand\nupright. Because it weakens if its skin\ndries out, it replenishes fluids by playing\nin mud.", // 259: Marshtomp
    "巨沼怪非常强壮，拥有足以轻松拖动一吨以上巨岩的力量。这只宝可梦还具备强大的视力，即使在浑浊的水中也能看清事物。\u0001If it senses the approach of a storm and\na tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest\nby piling up boulders. It swims as fast as\na jet ski.", // 260: Swampert
    "土狼犬一见到会动的东西就会咬上去。这只宝可梦会追逐猎物直到对方精疲力竭。不过，如果猎物反击，它也可能掉头逃跑。\u0001It savagely threatens foes with bared\nfangs. It chases after fleeing targets\ntenaciously. It turns tail and runs,\nhowever, if the foe strikes back.", // 261: Poochyena
    "它会成群结队地追捕猎物。对于训练家的命令，它绝不会违抗。\u0001In the wild, MIGHTYENA live in a pack.\nThey never defy their leader's orders.\nThey defeat foes with perfectly\ncoordinated teamwork.", // 262: Mightyena
    "会用背上的硬毛摩擦树木，留下代表自己地盘的标记。 性情比伽勒尔的蛇纹熊温驯。\u0001Rubbing its nose against the ground, it\nalways wanders about back and forth in\nsearch of something. It is distinguished\nby the zigzag footprints it leaves.", // 263: Zigzagoon
    "体毛拥有良好的韧度与质感。 用它身上掉下来的毛制成的 剃须刷是最上等的高级货。\u0001It is exceedingly fast if it only has to run\nin a straight line. When it spots pond-\ndwelling prey underwater, it quickly leaps\nin and catches it with its sharp claws.", // 264: Linoone
    "刺尾虫会用尾部的尖刺剥开树皮，吸食渗出的树汁。这只宝可梦的脚上长有吸盘，能牢牢吸附在玻璃上而不滑落。\u0001It sticks to tree branches and eats\nleaves. The thread it spits from its mouth,\nwhich becomes gooey when it touches\nair, slows the movement of its foes.", // 265: Wurmple
    "甲壳茧会用丝将自己固定在树枝上以防掉落。这只宝可梦就这样静静悬挂着，等待进化。它会透过丝茧上的小孔向外窥视。\u0001It prepares for evolution using the\nenergy it stored while it was a WURMPLE.\nIt keeps watch over the surroundings with\nits two eyes.", // 266: Silcoon
    "狩猎凤蝶最喜欢的食物是花朵甜美的花粉。如果你想见到这只宝可梦，只需在敞开的窗边放一盆花。狩猎凤蝶一定会来寻找花粉。\u0001Its colorfully patterned wings are its\nmost prominent feature. It flies through\nflower-covered fields collecting pollen.\nIt attacks ferociously when angered.", // 267: Beautifly
    "盾甲茧会用口中吐出的细丝将全身包裹起来，制成防护茧。丝线缠绕身体后会变硬。这只宝可梦在茧中为进化做准备。\u0001To avoid detection by its enemies, it hides\nmotionlessly beneath large leaves and in\nthe gaps of branches. It also attaches\ndead leaves to its body for camouflage.", // 268: Cascoon
    "毒粉蛾天生会被光线吸引。城市的明亮灯光会引来成群的这只宝可梦，它们剥食行道树的树叶，造成严重破坏。\u0001It is a nocturnal POKéMON that flies from\nfields and mountains to the attraction of\nstreetlights at night. It looses highly\ntoxic powder from its wings.", // 269: Dustox
    "会走来走去寻找清水。 如果长时间不饮水的话，头上的叶子就会枯萎。\u0001This POKéMON lives in ponds with clean\nwater. It is known to ferry small POKéMON\nacross ponds by carrying them on the\nbroad leaf on its head.", // 270: Lotad
    "傍晚时开始活动的 夜行性宝可梦。 喜欢吃河底的水苔。\u0001In the evening, it takes great delight in\npopping out of rivers and startling people.\nIt feeds on aquatic moss that grows on\nrocks in the riverbed.", // 271: Lombre
    "快乐的音乐节奏会让 乐天河童的细胞活性化，使其发挥出强大的力量。\u0001When it hears festive music, all the cells\nin its body become stimulated, and it\nbegins moving in rhythm. It does not\nquail even when it faces a tough opponent.", // 272: Ludicolo
    "在它一动不动的时候，看上去和树果没有分别。 以吓唬来啄食自己的宝可梦为乐。\u0001It hangs off branches and absorbs\nnutrients. When it finishes eating, its\nbody becomes so heavy that it drops to\nthe ground with a thump.", // 273: Seedot
    "栖息于森林的深处。 会用头上的叶子做成笛子，吹出令人感到不安的音色。\u0001A forest-dwelling POKéMON that is skilled\nat climbing trees. Its long and pointed\nnose is its weak point. It loses power if\nthe nose is gripped.", // 274: Nuzleaf
    "过去被敬畏为森林之神的宝可梦。 有着读取对手想法并 抢先一步行动的能力。\u0001It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds.\nFeared from long ago as the guardian of\nforests, this POKéMON lives in a deep\nforest where people do not venture.", // 275: Shiftry
    "傲骨燕会勇敢地面对敌人，无论对方多么强大。这只胆大的宝可梦即使战败也绝不屈服。另一方面，它饿的时候会大声啼哭。\u0001Although it is small, it is very courageous.\nIt will take on a larger SKARMORY on an\nequal footing. However, its will weakens if\nit becomes hungry.", // 276: Taillow
    "大王燕在我们头顶高高飞翔，在空中画出优美的弧线。这只宝可梦一旦发现猎物，就会以陡峭的角度俯冲而下。不幸的猎物会被大王燕的利爪紧紧抓住，无法逃脱。\u0001A SWELLOW dives upon prey from far above.\nIt never misses its targets. It takes to\nthe skies in search of lands with a warm\nclimate.", // 277: Swellow
    "为了轻盈，骨骼空空的。 用大大的翅膀迎风，向着浩瀚天空飞翔。\u0001It makes its nest on a sheer cliff at the\nedge of the sea. It has trouble keeping\nits wings flapping in flight. Instead, it\nsoars on updrafts.", // 278: Wingull
    "鸟嘴鼓得大大的，幼儿园小朋友这么大的孩子 正好能完全进入。\u0001It skims the tops of waves as it flies.\nWhen it spots prey, it uses its large beak\nto scoop up the victim with water.\nIt protects its eggs in its beak.", // 279: Pelipper
    "能敏锐地捕捉人和宝可梦的感情。 感受到敌意后就会躲进暗处。\u0001A RALTS has the power to sense the\nemotions of people and POKéMON with the\nhorns on its head. It takes cover if it\nsenses any hostility.", // 280: Ralts
    "当训练家高兴的时候，奇鲁莉安会充满能量，开心地转着圈跳舞。\u0001A KIRLIA has the psychic power to create \na rip in the dimensions and see into the\nfuture. It is said to dance with pleasure\non sunny mornings.", // 281: Kirlia
    "有着预知未来的能力。 在保护训练家的时候，会发挥出最强的力量。\u0001It apparently does not feel the pull of\ngravity because it supports itself with\npsychic power. It will give its life to\nprotect its TRAINER.", // 282: Gardevoir
    "在水面像滑行一样移动。 为了寻找食物，几次三番和滴蛛打架。\u0001They gather on puddles after evening\ndownpours, gliding across the surface\nof water as if sliding. It secretes honey\nwith a sweet aroma from its head.", // 283: Surskit
    "用触角上的眼珠花纹威吓敌人。 用4根翅膀前后左右灵活飞行。\u0001It intimidates foes with the large eyelike\npatterns on its antennae. Because it can't\nfly if its wings get wet, it shelters itself\nfrom rain under large trees and eaves.", // 284: Masquerain
    "蘑蘑菇生活在森林深处阴暗潮湿的土壤中。它们经常一动不动地待在落叶下。这只宝可梦以腐烂落叶形成的堆肥为食。\u0001It loves to eat damp, composted soil in\nforests. If you enter a forest after a\nlong rain, you can see many SHROOMISH\nfeasting on composted soil.", // 285: Shroomish
    "斗笠菇以轻快敏捷的步法逼近对手，然后用伸缩自如的手臂出拳。这只宝可梦的战斗技巧足以让拳击手自愧不如。\u0001It scatters spores from holes in the cap\non its head. It loves warm and humid\nclimates. It feeds on trees and plants in\nfields and forests.", // 286: Breloom
    "懒人獭每天有超过二十个小时在闲晃。因为它几乎不怎么活动，所以不需要太多食物。这只宝可梦每天只吃三片叶子。\u0001It sleeps virtually all day and night long.\nIt doesn't change its nest its entire life,\nbut it sometimes travels great distances\nby swimming in rivers.", // 287: Slakoth
    "过动猿总是浑身发痒、焦躁不安，想要大闹一场。它连一分钟都静不下来。如果无法持续活动，这只宝可梦的压力就会上升。\u0001It can't keep still because its blood boils\nwith energy. It runs through the fields\nand mountains all day to calm itself. If it\ndoesn't, it can't sleep at night.", // 288: Vigoroth
    "请假王整天躺着无所事事。它只吃自己够得到的草。如果周围的草都吃光了，这只宝可梦才会不情愿地挪到别处。\u0001Hordes of SLAKING gather around trees\nwhen fruits come into season. They wait\naround patiently for ripened fruits to fall\nout of the trees.", // 289: Slaking
    "因为长时间生活在地下，所以眼睛几乎什么都看不到。 会靠触角来探察周围的情况。\u0001It makes its nest at the roots of a mighty\ntree. Using its whiskerlike antennae, it\nprobes its surroundings in the\npitch-black darkness of soil.", // 290: Nincada
    "如果一直听它的叫声，就会让人头痛不止。 会以眼睛无法看清的速度移动。\u0001Because it darts about vigorously at high\nspeed, it is very difficult to see. Hearing\nits distinctive cries for too long induces\na headache.", // 291: Ninjask
    "它是一种在土居忍士进化时，会神不知鬼不觉地出现在 精灵球里的神奇宝可梦。\u0001A peculiar POKéMON that floats in air even\nthough its wings remain completely still.\nThe inside of its body is hollow and\nutterly dark.", // 292: Shedinja
    "叫声的音量超过了100分贝。 如果听到它在近处大叫，之后的一整天都会头痛不止。\u0001Its cries equal a jet plane in volume.\nIt inhales through its ear canals. Because\nof this system, it can cry continually\nwithout having to catch its breath.", // 293: Whismur
    "它的耳朵有着扬声器的功能。 会从耳朵中发射出威力足以 掀翻一整座房子的音波。\u0001It positions the round speakers on its\nhead to assail foes with ultrasonic waves\nat massive volume. It builds power by\nstomping the ground.", // 294: Loudred
    "以前的人们曽利用 爆音怪发出的巨响，与相隔遥远的城镇居民联系。\u0001It has sound-generating organs all over\nits body. It communicates with others by\nadjusting the tone and volume of the cries\nit emits.", // 295: Exploud
    "最早是从其他地区被带到这儿来的，但现在阿罗拉的幕下力士比较有名。\u0001It loves to toughen up its body above all\nelse. If you hear quaking rumbles in a cave,\nit is the sound of MAKUHITA undertaking\nstrenuous training.", // 296: Makuhita
    "因怪力而为人所知，但上了年纪后就会停止战斗，转而负责训练幕下力士。\u0001It has the habit of challenging others\nwithout hesitation to tests of strength.\nIt's been known to stand on train tracks\nand stop trains using forearm thrusts.", // 297: Hariyama
    "球形的尾巴拥有如同 橡胶球一般的弹性，里面 贮满了它成长所需的营养。\u0001Its tail, which is packed with nutrition,\nis very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny\ndays they gather at the edge of water and\nsplash about for fun.", // 298: Azurill
    "朝北鼻鼻子上的磁铁绝对不会失灵，所以是训练家旅行时的良伴。\u0001Its body emits a powerful magnetism.\nIt feeds on prey that is pulled in by the\nforce. Its magnetism is stronger in cold\nseasons.", // 299: Nosepass
    "向尾喵有个习惯，会被移动的物体吸引并追着它们跑。这只宝可梦以追着自己的尾巴转圈直到头晕而闻名。\u0001A SKITTY's adorably cute behavior makes it\nhighly popular. In battle, it makes its tail\npuff out. It threatens foes with a sharp\ngrowl.", // 300: Skitty
    "优雅猫喜欢无拘无束的生活，可以随心所欲地按自己的步调行事。因为这只宝可梦想吃就吃、想睡就睡，所以它的日常作息完全没有规律。\u0001Rather than keeping a permanent lair,\nit habitually seeks comfortable spots and\nsleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes\nactive at dusk.", // 301: Delcatty
    "非常喜欢宝石，因此到处追着小碎钻。 但却被尖牙陆鲨半路夺走。\u0001It digs branching holes in caves using its\nsharp claws in search of food--raw gems.\nA SABLEYE lurks in darkness and is seen\nonly rarely.", // 302: Sableye
    "狡黠而又恐怖的宝可梦。 用可爱的举止让人麻痹大意，然后出其不意地用大颚一口吞下。\u0001Its giant jaws are actually steel horns\nthat transformed. It fools foes into\ncomplacency with its adorable gestures,\nthen chomps them with its huge jaws.", // 303: Mawile
    "食用铁矿石，偶尔也会吃 铁路的轨道，从而打造出 保护身体的钢铁盔甲。\u0001A POKéMON that is clad in steel armor.\nA new suit of armor is made when it evolves.\nThe old, discarded armor is salvaged as\nmetal for making iron products.", // 304: Aron
    "由于可多拉所栖息的山上 有着丰富的泉水和铁矿石，因此经常会与人类发生争端。\u0001When two LAIRON meet in the wild, they\nfight for territory by bashing into each\nother with their steel bodies. The sound\nof their collision carries for miles.", // 305: Lairon
    "会用能够刺穿铁板的 锐利尖角在撞击敌人的 同时攻击对方。\u0001Its iron horns grow longer a little at\na time. They are used to determine the\nAGGRON's age. The gouges in its armor are\nworn with pride as mementos from battles.", // 306: Aggron
    "玛沙那会在深山里进行严格的精神训练。然而，每当它冥想时，这只宝可梦总是无法集中注意力。因此，它的训练永远没有尽头。\u0001It continually meditates for hours every\nday. As a result of rigorous and dedicated\nyoga training, it has tempered its\nspiritual power so much it can fly.", // 307: Meditite
    "据说恰雷姆通过冥想提升体内的能量，并磨炼第六感。这只宝可梦会将自己融入原野和山峦之中，隐藏气息。\u0001Through crushingly harsh yoga training, it\ngained the power to foretell its foe's\nactions. It battles with elegant, dance-\nlike movement.", // 308: Medicham
    "通过空气与体毛的摩擦产生静电。 落雷兽如果奔跑，会发出噼里啪啦的声音。\u0001It generates electricity using friction\nfrom the atmosphere. In seasons with\nespecially arid air, its entire body blazes\nwith violent showers of sparks.", // 309: Electrike
    "在不自然的雷云之下有着雷电兽。 听说会用和雷同等的速度奔驰。\u0001Because lightning falls in their vicinities,\nMANECTRIC were thought to have been born\nfrom lightning. In battle, they create\nthunderclouds.", // 310: Manectric
    "正电拍拍总是担任伙伴们的啦啦队。每当队友在战斗中表现出色时，这只宝可梦就会让身体短路，发出噼啪的电气声来表达喜悦。\u0001It has the trait of cheering on its fellow\nPOKéMON. By shorting out the electricity\nit releases from its paws, it creates\npom-poms for cheering.", // 311: Plusle
    "负电拍拍比起自身安全，更关心为伙伴加油助威。它会释放体内储存的电力，制造出绚丽的火花，为队友鼓舞士气。\u0001At a meeting of POKéMON academics, it was\nannounced that simultaneous exposure to\nelectricity from a PLUSLE and MINUN will\npromote circulation and boost vitality.", // 312: Minun
    "夜幕降临，电萤虫便会从尾部发出光芒。它通过调节光的强度和闪烁频率与同伴交流。这种宝可梦会被甜甜萤的甜美香气所吸引。\u0001With their taillights lit, VOLBEAT fly in\na swarm, drawing geometric designs in the\nnight sky. They move their nests if their\npond water becomes dirty.", // 313: Volbeat
    "甜甜萤用甜美的香气吸引成群的电萤虫。当电萤虫聚集后，它会带领这群发光的伙伴在夜空画布上绘制几何图案。\u0001A nocturnal POKéMON that becomes active\nupon nightfall. It leads a VOLBEAT swarm\nto draw patterns in the night sky. Over 200\ndifferent patterns have been confirmed.", // 314: Illumise
    "只要闻到它的花香，就能放松心情。浓郁的香味 是毒蔷薇有活力的证明。\u0001A ROSELIA that drinks nutritionally rich\nspringwater blooms with lovely flowers.\nThe fragrance of its flowers has the\neffect of making its foes careless.", // 315: Roselia
    "它的心脏和大脑都很小。胃占据了身体的大部分，胃里的酶能溶解任何东西。\u0001This POKéMON's stomach fluid can even\ndigest scrap iron. In one gulp, it can\nswallow something that is as large as\nitself.", // 316: Gulpin
    "当吞食兽发现猎物时，会从毛孔中喷出剧毒液体射向目标。待猎物虚弱后，它便用巨大的嘴巴将猎物整个吞下。\u0001Its powerful stomach acid is capable of\ndigesting almost anything. The one thing\nin the whole world a SWALOT can't digest is\nits own stomach.", // 317: Swalot
    "每个群体都拥有自己的领地。 对于入侵者，会毫不留情地 露出牙齿发动袭击。\u0001CARVANHA attack ships in swarms, making\nthem sink. Although it is said to be a very\nvicious POKéMON, it timidly flees as soon\nas it finds itself alone.", // 318: Carvanha
    "以120公里的时速追击猎物，用连铁都能咬碎的牙齿捕杀。 通常称之为大海恶霸。\u0001The vicious and sly gangster of the sea.\nIts skin is specially textured to minimize\ndrag in water. Its speed tops out at over\n75 miles per hour.", // 319: Sharpedo
    "喜欢吓人。 喝入海水鼓成球一样，弹跳着玩。\u0001While this POKéMON usually lives in the sea,\nit can survive on land, although not too\nlong. It loses vitality if its body becomes\ndried out.", // 320: Wailmer
    "有成群结队追逐猎物的习性。 用大大的嘴巴将弱丁鱼群 一口气尽数吞下。\u0001It breathes through nostrils that it\nraises above the sea. By inhaling to its\nmaximum capacity, a WAILORD can dive close\nto 10,000 feet beneath the waves.", // 321: Wailord
    "呆火驼极其迟钝——即使被击中也不会察觉。但它一刻也无法忍受饥饿。这种宝可梦的身体就像沸腾的岩浆大锅。\u0001A NUMEL stores boiling magma in the hump\non its back. It is a hardy POKéMON that can\ntransport a 220-pound load. It has served\nhumans at work since long ago.", // 322: Numel
    "喷火驼体内有一座火山。华氏18000度的岩浆在其体内流动。有时它背上的驼峰会喷发，喷出炽热的岩浆。\u0001A POKéMON that lives in the crater of\na volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes\non its back erupt violently. Research is\nunder way on the cause of eruption.", // 323: Camerupt
    "煤炭是其能量的来源。 在煤炭龟栖息着的山里，沉睡着大量的煤炭。\u0001It battles using energy it gets from\nburning coal. When loosing smoke from its\nnostrils, it lets off a sound that is\nsimilar to a locomotive's horn.", // 324: Torkoal
    "跳跳猪用尾巴弹跳。弹跳的冲击力使其心脏保持跳动。因此，这种宝可梦一刻也不能停止弹跳——一旦停下，心脏就会停止跳动。\u0001A POKéMON that manipulates psychic power\nat will. It doesn't stop bouncing even when\nit is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms\nthat grow underground.", // 325: Spoink
    "噗噗猪利用身上的黑珍珠放大超能力波，从而完全控制对手。当这种宝可梦使用特殊能力时，它的鼻息会变得急促。\u0001It stores power in the black pearls on its\nforehead. When it uses psychic power, it\nperforms an odd dance step. Its style of\ndancing became hugely popular overseas.", // 326: Grumpig
    "晃晃悠悠，步伐不稳健，但晃晃斑自己是打算要 笔直走路的哦。\u0001It is distinguished by a pattern of\nspots that is always different. Its\nunsteady, tottering walk has the\neffect of fouling its foe's aim.", // 327: Spinda
    "一整个星期什么都不吃 也能生存。一动不动地呆在 巢穴底部等待猎物的到来。\u0001Its big jaws crunch through boulders.\nBecause its head is so big, it has a hard\ntime getting back upright if it tips over\nonto its back.", // 328: Trapinch
    "还不发达的翅膀，比起飞行，反而更多地用于 通过摩擦产生超音波攻击敌人。\u0001It looses ultrasonic waves by rubbing its\nwings together. Since a VIBRAVA's wings\nare still in the process of growing, it can\nonly fly short distances.", // 329: Vibrava
    "挥动翅膀的声音简直就是歌声。 凡是被这声音迷惑的，最终会被卷入沙暴成为沙漠蜻蜓的食物。\u0001The flapping of its wings sounds like\nsinging. To prevent detection by enemies,\nit hides itself by flapping up a cloud of\ndesert sand.", // 330: Flygon
    "刺球仙人掌生活在沙漠等干旱地区。它会从花朵释放强烈香气吸引猎物。当猎物靠近时，这种宝可梦会从身体射出尖锐的刺将猎物击倒。\u0001CACNEA live in deserts with virtually no\nrainfall. It battles by swinging its thick,\nspiked arms. Once a year, a yellow flower\nblooms.", // 331: Cacnea
    "白天，梦歌仙人掌保持不动，以免在严酷的沙漠阳光下流失水分。这种宝可梦在气温下降的夜晚变得活跃。\u0001After spending thousands of years in\nharsh deserts, its blood transformed into\nthe same substances as sand. It is\nnocturnal, so it hunts at night.", // 332: Cacturne
    "像丝绵一样的翅膀中含有 空气，触感蓬松。绝不会 忽视对翅膀精细地保养。\u0001A POKéMON that has wings like cottony\nclouds. After enduring winter, in which\nlittle food is available, SWABLU flocks\nmove closer to towns in the spring.", // 333: Swablu
    "一边舒适地在天空中飞翔，一边发出优美的哼唱，让听到之人都为之沉醉。\u0001It hums in a beautiful soprano voice.\nIt flies among white clouds in the blue\nsky. It launches intensely hot fireballs\nfrom its mouth.", // 334: Altaria
    "它与饭匙蛇世代为敌。锋利的爪子是它最大的武器。\u0001When it battles, it stands on its hind legs\nand attacks with its sharply clawed\nforelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters\nany SEVIPER.", // 335: Zangoose
    "饭匙蛇与猫鼬斩有着延续数代的世仇。它身上的伤疤是激烈战斗的证明。这种宝可梦使用如剑般的尾巴进行攻击。\u0001SEVIPER and ZANGOOSE are eternal rivals.\nIt counters a ZANGOOSE's dazzling agility\nwith its swordlike tail, which also oozes\na horrible poison.", // 336: Seviper
    "月亮的盈缺似乎会 影响它力量的增减。 每到满月之夜就会变得活跃。\u0001It becomes very active on the night of\na full moon. This POKéMON was first\ndiscovered 40 years ago at the site of\na meteor strike.", // 337: Lunatone
    "当它旋转自己的身体时，会发出太阳般的光芒，让敌人的眼睛暂时失明。\u0001Solar energy is the source of this \nPOKéMON's power. On sunny days, groups of\nSOLROCK line up facing the sun and absorb\nits light.", // 338: Solrock
    "全身滑腻腻的。 即使被鸟宝可梦啄到，也能哧溜一下滑着逃走。\u0001Its body is covered with a slimy film.\nThe film acts as a barrier to prevent germs\nin muddy water from entering the\nBARBOACH's body.", // 339: Barboach
    "只要是动的东西，无论什么都会 咬住不放大吃特吃。平常就一直埋伏 在沼泽底部一动不动地等待着猎物。\u0001Mysteriously, it can foretell earthquakes.\nIn the daytime, it sleeps in mud at the\nbottom of a pond. When it awakens, it\ncontinually feeds throughout the night.", // 340: Whiscash
    "被没有坚持培育的训练家放生了的 个体在增加，即使在阿罗拉也变得 时常能见到了。\u0001Once it grips prey with its large pincers,\nit will never let go, no matter what.\nIt is a hardy POKéMON that can thrive\nin any environment.", // 341: Corphish
    "性格暴躁，喜欢打架，但如果钳子掉落，就会一下子弱下来。 在再生之前，都会提心吊胆的。\u0001A brutish POKéMON that loves to battle.\nA veteran CRAWDAUNT that has prevailed in\nhundreds of battles has giant pincers\nmarked with countless scars.", // 342: Crawdaunt
    "在原始人所居住的洞穴墙壁上，描绘着像是天秤偶的宝可梦的样子。\u0001A BALTOY moves by spinning on its single\nfoot. It has been depicted in murals \nadorning the walls of a once-bustling city\nin an ancient age.", // 343: Baltoy
    "如果淋湿，身体就会溶解掉。 所以下雨时会用精神力量 包住全身，保护自己。\u0001A CLAYDOL sleeps while hovering in midair.\nIts arms are separate from its body.\nThey are kept floating by the POKéMON's\nmanipulation of psychic power.", // 344: Claydol
    "曾生活在古代温暖的海里。 伪装成海草，埋伏着等待猎物，等对方靠近的时候一口吞下。\u0001It disguises itself as seaweed by making\nits tentacles sway. Unsuspecting prey\nthat come too close are swallowed whole.\nIt became extinct 100 million years ago.", // 345: Lileep
    "平常栖息在海的浅滩底部，退潮的时候就爬到陆地上，四处寻找猎物。\u0001It drags its heavy body along the\nseafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows\nof warm seas. CRADILY can be seen on\nbeaches when the tide goes out.", // 346: Cradily
    "从化石复原而来的太古羽虫 即使放到海里，也不会有精神。 因为现在的水质已和当时不同了。\u0001It was resurrected from a fossil using the\npower of science. It swims by undulating\nthe eight wings at its sides. They were\nfeet that adapted to life in the sea.", // 347: Anorith
    "进化之后登上了陆地。 下半身得到了强化，尾巴的攻击破坏力极强。\u0001ARMALDO usually lives on land. However,\nwhen it hunts for prey, it dives beneath\nthe ocean. It swims around using its two\nlarge wings.", // 348: Armaldo
    "即使在脏水里也完全不介意的 强壮的宝可梦。但破破烂烂一副 寒酸的样子，所以不受欢迎。\u0001FEEBAS live in ponds that are heavily\ninfested with weeds. Because of its\nhopelessly shabby appearance, it\nseems as if few TRAINERS raise it.", // 349: Feebas
    "也被称为最美的宝可梦，一直给予许多艺术家灵感。\u0001It is said to live at the bottom of\nlarge lakes. Considered to be the most\nbeautiful of all POKéMON, it has been\ndepicted in paintings and statues.", // 350: Milotic
    "根据天气而改变样子。 听说气温和湿度的变化 对细胞有影响。\u0001It alters its form depending on the\nweather. Changes in the climate such as\nthe temperature and humidity appear to\naffect its cellular structure.", // 351: Castform
    "能改变身体的颜色，融入周围景色中。 如果长时间不管它，就会闹别扭不现身。\u0001A POKéMON that has the ability to alter its\nbody colors to match its surroundings.\nA KECLEON reverts to its original colors if\nit is startled.", // 352: Kecleon
    "因为会吞食类似于 怨恨、嫉妒之类的感情，所以对于有的人来说是可贵的存在。\u0001This POKéMON roams about deep in the\nnight seeking such negative emotions as\ngrudges and envy. It retreats to its nest\nwhen the sun begins to rise.", // 353: Shuppet
    "怨念附在被丢弃的玩偶身上，打算寻找丢弃自己的人来报仇。\u0001An abandoned plush doll became this\nPOKéMON. They are said to live in garbage\ndumps and wander about in search of the\nchildren that threw them away.", // 354: Banette
    "据说，一旦发现不听话的孩子，就会在深夜将其带去某个地方。\u0001A glare from its single scarlet eye makes\neven burly grown-ups freeze in utter fear.\nIt is a nocturnal POKéMON that roams\nabout under the cloak of darkness.", // 355: Duskull
    "身体内部是空的。 只要一张开嘴就会像 黑洞一样吸入所有东西\u0001It is thought that its body is hollow with\nonly a spectral ball of fire burning inside.\nHowever, no one has been able to\nconfirm this theory as fact.", // 356: Dusclops
    "栖息在阿罗拉的热带龙 脖子里结的那串水果比其他地区的 甜得多，是最最棒的。\u0001It flies by flapping its broad leaves.\nThe bunch of fruit that grows around its\nneck is deliciously sweet. In the spring,\nit scatters pollen from its neck.", // 357: Tropius
    "风铃铃让声音在它中空的身体里回响。当这种宝可梦愤怒时，它的叫声会变成超声波，能将对手击飞。\u0001They fly about very actively when the hot\nseason arrives. They communicate among\nthemselves using seven different and\ndistinguishing cries.", // 358: Chimecho
    "在迷信盛行的过去，因被认为会招来灾祸而遭到厌恶，并被赶到深山中去。\u0001It sharply senses even subtle changes in\nthe sky and the land to predict natural\ndisasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that\nhas a life-span of 100 years.", // 359: Absol
    "和大群伙伴一起行动，通过和伙伴彼此推挤 来锻炼自己的忍耐力。\u0001A WYNAUT loves to eat sweet fruits.\nIt cleverly picks fruits using its earlike\narms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn\nby the fragrance.", // 360: Wynaut
    "等发觉时，已在阿罗拉增多起来。 据说，雪童子栖息过的家庭 会子孙满堂家族繁荣。\u0001They tend to move about in groups of\naround five SNORUNT. In snowy regions,\nit is said that when they are seen late at\nnight, snowfall will arrive by morning.", // 361: Snorunt
    "据说是即将登顶雪山，却罹难的登山家的遗憾，附在岩石上诞生而成。\u0001A GLALIE has the power to instantaneously\nfreeze moisture in the atmosphere.\nA dazzling cloud of diamondlike ice\ncrystals forms around its body.", // 362: Glalie
    "圆溜溜的身体 被厚厚的脂肪包裹着，滚起来比走路要快。\u0001It is completely covered with plushy fur.\nAs a result, it never feels the cold even\nwhen it is rolling about on ice floes or\ndiving in the sea.", // 363: Spheal
    "在浮冰上生活。能一边游泳 一边分辨猎物的味道，找到 对方的位置并将其捕获。\u0001SEALEO live in herds on ice floes. Using its\npowerful flippers, it shatters ice.\nIt dives into the sea to hunt prey five\ntimes a day.", // 364: Sealeo
    "2、30只一起群居。 受到敌人袭击时，首领会拼命保护族群。\u0001To protect its herd, the leader battles\nanything that invades its territory, even\nat the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap\noff in battle.", // 365: Walrein
    "别看它长这样，它可是食肉的。 用2片外壳牢牢夹住猎物，直到完全不动了才会放开。\u0001A CLAMPERL slams its shell closed on prey\nto prevent escape. The pearl it creates\nupon evolution is said to be infused with\na mysterious energy.", // 366: Clamperl
    "游泳能力不太强。 会挥动尾巴来吸引猎物，在很接近的时候一口咬住。\u0001To withstand the crushing pressure of\nwater deep under the sea, its spine is very\nthick and sturdy. Its tail, which is shaped\nlike a small fish, has eyes that light up.", // 367: Huntail
    "身体的颜色根据水温而变化。 阿罗拉的樱花鱼呈现出 令人炫目的鲜艳色彩。\u0001A GOREBYSS siphons the body fluids of prey\nthrough its thin, tubular mouth. Its light\npink body color turns vivid when it\nfinishes feeding.", // 368: Gorebyss
    "从1亿年前起就是相同的样子。 因为体内富含脂肪，所以可以承受深海的水压。\u0001A POKéMON that was once believed to have\nbeen extinct. The species has not changed\nits form for 100 million years. It walks on\nthe seafloor using its pectoral fins.", // 369: Relicanth
    "变成只有独自1只的爱心鱼 无精打采地，尽是空虚。 就在那时被大嘴鸥叼走了。\u0001LUVDISC make the branches of CORSOLA\ntheir nests. There is a custom from long\nago of giving a LUVDISC as a gift to\nexpress one's feelings of love.", // 370: Luvdisc
    "它相信自己早晚能飞，听说是因为受到 遗传基因中信息的影响。\u0001Although it is small, this POKéMON is very\npowerful because its body is a bundle of\nmuscles. It launches head-butts with its\nironlike skull.", // 371: Bagon
    "细胞在壳中 以爆发般的速度变化，为进化做准备。\u0001It hardly eats while it awaits evolution.\nIt becomes hardier by enduring hunger.\nIts shell peels off the instant it begins\nto evolve.", // 372: Shelgon
    "一生气就会忘记自我，把周围 都破坏掉。破坏会持续不断，直到暴飞龙精疲力尽。\u0001After many long years, its cellular\nstructure underwent a sudden mutation to\ngrow wings. When angered, it loses all\nthought and rampages out of control.", // 373: Salamence
    "细胞全部是磁铁。 使用磁力和伙伴之间进行交流。\u0001When BELDUM gather in a swarm, they move\nin perfect unison as if they were but one\nPOKéMON. They communicate with each other\nusing brain waves.", // 374: Beldum
    "2只铁哑铃组合起来，精神力量也变为2倍。 但是智商并没有发生改变。\u0001The claws tipping its arms pack the\ndestructive power to tear through thick\niron sheets as if they were silk. It flies\nat over 60 miles per hour.", // 375: Metang
    "用4只爪子和庞大的身体 牢牢地按住猎物后，用腹部的牙齿嘎嘣嘎嘣地啃咬。\u0001METAGROSS has four brains that are joined\nby a complex neural network. As a result of\nintegration, this POKéMON is smarter than\na supercomputer.", // 376: Metagross
    "身上任何一个部分都由 岩石构成。即使身体磨损了 也会自己用岩石去修补。\u0001A POKéMON that is made entirely of rocks\nand boulders. If parts of its body chip off\nin battle, REGIROCK repairs itself by\nadding new rocks.", // 377: Regirock
    "会操控冰冷至零下200度 的冷气，将接近自己的 家伙一下子冰镇起来。\u0001Its entire body is made of Antarctic ice.\nAfter extensive studies, researchers\nbelieve the ice was formed during an\nice age.", // 378: Regice
    "虽然也拥有能伸能缩的柔软性，但它其实是由比任何金属 都要结实的神秘物质构成的。\u0001Its body is harder than any other kind of\nmetal. The body metal is composed of a\nmysterious substance. Not only is it hard,\nit shrinks and stretches flexibly.", // 379: Registeel
    "拉帝亚斯对人类的情感非常敏感。如果察觉到敌意，这种宝可梦会竖起全身的羽毛，发出尖锐的叫声来威慑对手。\u0001They make a small herd of only several\nmembers. They rarely make contact with\npeople or other POKéMON. They disappear\nif they sense enemies.", // 380: Latias
    "拉帝欧斯能让对手看到它脑海中曾见过或想象出的影像。这种宝可梦很聪明，能理解人类的语言。\u0001Even in hiding, it can detect the locations\nof others and sense their emotions since\nit has telepathy. Its intelligence allows\nit to understand human languages.", // 381: Latios
    "盖欧卡拥有制造巨大雨云的能力，能遮蔽整个天空并引发倾盆大雨。这种宝可梦曾拯救过遭受干旱之苦的人们。\u0001KYOGRE has appeared in mythology as the\ncreator of the sea. After long years of\nfeuding with GROUDON, it took to sleep at\nthe bottom of the sea.", // 382: Kyogre
    "固拉多在神话中一直被描述为抬高陆地、扩张大陆的宝可梦。在与盖欧卡进行了一场灾难性的战斗后，这种宝可梦陷入了沉睡。\u0001GROUDON has appeared in mythology as the\ncreator of the land. It sleeps in magma\nunderground and is said to make volcanoes\nerupt on awakening.", // 383: Groudon
    "烈空坐在地球的臭氧层中生活了数亿年，从未降落到地面。这种宝可梦似乎以大气中的水分和粒子为食。\u0001A POKéMON that flies endlessly in the\nozone layer. It is said it would descend\nto the ground if KYOGRE and GROUDON\nwere to fight.", // 384: Rayquaza
    "每1000年让它听一次 清澈的歌声，就能让它 维持7天的清醒。\u0001JIRACHI is said to make wishes come true.\nWhile it sleeps, a tough crystalline shell\nenvelops the body to protect it from\nenemies.", // 385: Jirachi
